return <<<'SQL'
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovni motori svih vrsta na jednom mestu: sportski i naked motocikli, enduro i kros motori, čoperi i turistički motori, skuteri i mopedi, kao i kvadovi za rad i zabavu. Najviše oglasa ima za [Yamaha](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/yamaha), [KTM](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/ktm), Honda i Suzuki motore i za [Vespa](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/vespa) skutere, a tu su i domaći [Tomos](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/tomos) mopedi i automatici. Sve češće se prodaju i električni skuteri, odnosno skuteri na struju, koji ne troše gorivo i lako se parkiraju u gradu. Skuteri do 50 kubika čest su prvi izbor za grad i za mlađe vozače, a kvadove za decu birajte prema uzrastu, jer imaju manju snagu i ograničenje brzine.

Pre kupovine proverite saobraćajnu dozvolu i da li se broj šasije poklapa sa papirima, zatim lanac i lančanik, gume, kočnice i amortizere, i dogovorite probnu vožnju. Kod polovnih kvadova i enduro motora pogledajte ram i zglobove, jer se često voze po terenu. Prodavci neka navedu kubikažu, godište i kilometražu. Kacige, jakne i rukavice za vožnju naći ćete u rubrici [moto oprema](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema).', text_en = 'Used motorcycles of every kind in one place: sports and naked bikes, enduro and motocross bikes, choppers and tourers, scooters and mopeds, plus quads for work and fun. Most ads are for [Yamaha](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/yamaha), [KTM](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/ktm), Honda and Suzuki bikes and [Vespa](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/vespa) scooters, along with the home-grown [Tomos](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/tomos) mopeds and automatics. Electric scooters are sold more and more often: they use no fuel and are easy to park in town. Scooters up to 50 cc are a common first choice for the city and for younger riders, and kids'' quads should match the child''s age, as they have less power and a speed limiter.

Before buying, check the registration certificate and that the frame number matches the papers, then the chain and sprocket, tyres, brakes and shock absorbers, and arrange a test ride. With used quads and enduro bikes, look at the frame and joints, as they are often ridden off-road. Sellers should state the engine size, year and mileage. Helmets, jackets and gloves for riding are in the [motorcycle gear](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema) section.' WHERE slug = 'motorcycles' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Polovni motori, skuteri, mopedi i kvadovi: [Yamaha](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/yamaha), [Tomos](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/tomos), [KTM](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/ktm), [Vespa](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/vespa) i Piaggio, Honda, BMW i druge marke.

Proverite papire i registraciju, stanje lanca, guma i kočnica i dogovorite probnu vožnju. Prodavci neka navedu kubikažu, godište i kilometražu. Kacige i jakne za vožnju naći ćete u rubrici [moto oprema](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Used motorcycles, scooters, mopeds and quads: [Yamaha](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/yamaha), [Tomos](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/tomos), [KTM](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/ktm), [Vespa](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli/vespa) and Piaggio, Honda, BMW and other makes.

Check the papers and registration, the chain, tyres and brakes, and arrange a test ride. Sellers should state the engine size, year and mileage. Helmets and riding jackets are in the [motorcycle gear](/oglasi/vozila/moto-oprema) section.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Auto delovi, novi i polovni, za sve marke: delovi motora i menjača, karoserija i limarija, trap i vešanje, kočnice, [farovi i svetla](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi/svetla), akumulatori, auspusi i delovi enterijera. Ovde se oglašavaju auto otpadi i prodavnice delova, ali i vlasnici koji posle prodaje automobila nude ono što im je ostalo. Delove za BMW, Volkswagen, Ford, Opel, Renault i druge marke lakše ćete naći ako u pretragu upišete marku i model, a vrstu dela birate u filteru.

Pre kupovine uporedite kataloški broj ili proverite deo po broju šasije, jer se delovi istog modela razlikuju po godištu i motoru. Polovan deo pogledajte uživo ili tražite jasne fotografije i pitajte da li prodavac daje garanciju i prima povraćaj. Ako vam se više isplati ceo automobil, pogledajte [polovne automobile](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), ugradnju prepustite nekom od [auto servisa](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi), a točkove potražite među oglasima za [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).', text_en = 'Car parts, new and used, for every make: engine and gearbox parts, body panels, suspension and steering, brakes, [headlights and lights](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi/svetla), batteries, exhausts and interior parts. Breakers'' yards and parts shops advertise here, and so do owners who sell what is left after selling their car. Parts for BMW, Volkswagen, Ford, Opel, Renault and other makes are easier to find if you type the make and model into the search, and you choose the type of part in the filter.

Before buying, compare the part number or check the part against the VIN, as parts of the same model differ by year and engine. See a used part in person or ask for clear photos, and ask whether the seller gives a warranty and accepts returns. If a whole car makes more sense, see [used cars](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), leave the fitting to one of the [car services](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi), and look for wheels among the ads for [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).' WHERE slug = 'car-parts' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Auto delovi, novi i polovni: delovi motora i menjača, karoserija, [svetla](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi/svetla), akumulatori, delovi trapa i enterijera za sve marke. Mnogi otpadi i prodavnice delova oglašavaju se ovde.

Pre kupovine proverite kataloški broj ili broj šasije i da li deo odgovara vašem modelu i godištu. Za polovne delove pitajte za garanciju i mogućnost povraćaja. Ugradnju prepustite stručnjaku: pogledajte [auto servise](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi), a za točkove rubriku [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Car parts, new and used: engine and gearbox parts, body panels, [lights](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi/svetla), batteries, suspension and interior parts for all makes. Many breakers and parts shops advertise here.

Before buying, check the part number or VIN and that the part fits your model and year. For used parts, ask about a warranty and returns. Leave the fitting to a specialist: see [car service](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi), and for wheels the [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne) section.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Zimske i letnje gume, all season gume, alu i čelične felne i kompleti točkova za automobile, kombije i džipove. Najlakše ćete naći odgovarajuće gume ako u pretragu upišete dimenziju, na primer 205/55 R16 ili 195/65 R15. U filteru birate da li tražite gume, felne ili gotove točkove, a uz njih se prodaju i ratkapne, distanceri i šrafovi za felne. Polovne gume su dobar izbor kada imaju dovoljno dubine šare, a prodavci ih često nude u kompletu od četiri komada, pred početak zimske ili letnje sezone.

Pre kupovine proverite dubinu šare, da li na boku ima pukotina ili zakrpa i godinu proizvodnje iz DOT oznake: stara guma gubi prianjanje i kada izgleda kao nova. Kod felni pitajte za raspon rupa (PCD), centralni otvor i ET i proverite da li su ravne, jer se iskrivljena felna mora ispravljati. Za montažu, balansiranje i ispravljanje felni potražite [vulkanizera](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi/vulkanizer) u svom gradu, a ostale delove za auto naći ćete u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).', text_en = 'Winter and summer tyres, all-season tyres, alloy and steel wheels and complete wheel sets for cars, vans and SUVs. The quickest way to the right tyres is to type the size into the search, for example 205/55 R16 or 195/65 R15. In the filter you choose tyres, wheels or ready-made wheel sets, and hubcaps, spacers and wheel bolts are sold alongside them. Used tyres are a good choice when there is enough tread left, and sellers often offer them as a set of four, before the winter or summer season.

Before buying, check the tread depth, whether there are cracks or patches on the sidewall and the year of manufacture in the DOT code: an old tyre loses grip even when it looks new. For wheels, ask about the bolt pattern (PCD), centre bore and offset (ET), and check that they are straight, as a bent wheel has to be repaired. For fitting, balancing and wheel straightening, find a [tyre shop](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi/vulkanizer) in your city; other car parts are in the [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi) section.' WHERE slug = 'tyres-wheels' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Gume i felne: zimske i letnje gume, all season gume, alu i čelične felne i kompleti točkova. Pretražujte po dimenziji i nađite ponude u svom gradu.

Proverite dimenziju i indeks nosivosti, dubinu šare i godinu proizvodnje (DOT oznaka na boku gume). Kod felni pitajte za raspon rupa (PCD) i ET. Za montažu i balansiranje potražite [vulkanizera](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi/vulkanizer) u svom gradu, a sve ostalo za auto je u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Tyres and wheels: winter and summer tyres, all-season tyres, alloy and steel wheels and complete wheel sets. Search by size and find offers in your city.

Check the size and load index, the tread depth and the year of manufacture (the DOT code on the sidewall). For wheels, ask about the bolt pattern (PCD) and offset (ET). For fitting and balancing, find a [tyre shop](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi/vulkanizer) in your city; everything else for the car is under [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Auto servisi i majstori za sve što automobilu treba: mali i veliki servis, zamena ulja i filtera, kompjuterska dijagnostika, auto električari, servis automatskih menjača, punjenje i servis auto klime, kao i limari i farbari. Tu su i [vulkanizerske radnje](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi/vulkanizer) za sezonsku zamenu i balansiranje guma, mobilni vulkanizeri koji dolaze na adresu i perionice automobila. Vrstu usluge birate u filteru, a filter po mestu pokazuje majstore u vašem gradu.

Pre popravke tražite procenu cene i roka i pitajte da li daju garanciju na rad i na ugrađene delove, a kod većih kvarova zamolite da vam pokažu zamenjene delove. Servisi i majstori mogu besplatno da postave oglas sa adresom, radnim vremenom i spiskom usluga. Delove možete kupiti i sami u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), nove gume naći ćete među oglasima za [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), a ako auto ne može sam do servisa, pozovite [šlep službu](/oglasi/usluge/slep-sluzba).', text_en = 'Car services and mechanics for everything a car needs: minor and major services, oil and filter changes, computer diagnostics, auto electricians, automatic gearbox repair, car air conditioning refills and service, plus body and paint shops. There are also [tyre shops](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi/vulkanizer) for seasonal changes and balancing, mobile tyre fitters who come to your address, and car washes. You choose the type of service in the filter, and the place filter shows the mechanics in your city.

Before a repair, ask for a quote and a deadline and whether they give a warranty on the work and the fitted parts, and for bigger faults ask to see the replaced parts. Garages and mechanics can post an ad for free with their address, opening hours and list of services. You can buy parts yourself in the [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi) section, new tyres are among the ads for [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), and if the car cannot get to the garage on its own, call [towing](/oglasi/usluge/slep-sluzba).' WHERE slug = 'car-service' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Auto servisi i vulkanizeri: mehaničari, autoelektričari, limari i farbari, dijagnostika i [vulkanizerske radnje](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi/vulkanizer) u vašem gradu.

Pre popravke tražite procenu cene i rok, i pitajte za garanciju na rad i delove. Servisi mogu besplatno da postave oglas sa adresom i radnim vremenom. Delove za popravku nađite u rubrici [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), a ako auto ne može sam do servisa, tu je [šlep služba](/oglasi/usluge/slep-sluzba).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Car service and tyre repair: mechanics, auto electricians, body and paint shops, diagnostics and [tyre shops](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi/vulkanizer) in your city.

Before a repair, ask for a quote and deadline and about the warranty on work and parts. Garages can post an ad with their address and opening hours for free. Find parts for the repair under [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), and if the car cannot make it to the garage on its own, there is [towing](/oglasi/usluge/slep-sluzba).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = '[Kuće na prodaju](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja) u gradu i na selu: porodične kuće, stare kuće za renoviranje, seoske kuće sa okućnicom i imanja, vikend kuće i nove kuće sa dvorištem. Kupci najčešće traže kuće oko velikih gradova, pa pogledajte ponudu za [kuće u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd) i okolini ili [kuće u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad) i okolnim mestima. Ima i [kuća za izdavanje](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje) na duži rok, kao i kuća sa bazenom koje se iznajmljuju na dan za odmor i proslave. Vrstu ponude birate u filteru, a mestom i cenom sužavate izbor da biste našli i jeftine kuće u kraju koji vam odgovara.

Pre kupovine proverite list nepokretnosti, da li je kuća uknjižena ili legalizovana i da li ima građevinsku i upotrebnu dozvolu, jer od toga zavisi i kredit. Obiđite kuću uživo i pogledajte krov, vlagu u zidovima, instalacije i priključke za struju, vodu i kanalizaciju. Kod kuća na selu raspitajte se za put do placa i za podsticaje koje opština ili država daju za kupovinu seoske kuće. Dobar oglas navodi površinu kuće i placa, broj soba, vrstu grejanja i godinu gradnje.', text_en = '[Houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja) in town and in the countryside: family homes, old houses to renovate, village houses with a garden and farmsteads, weekend houses and new houses with a yard. Buyers mostly look around the big cities, so see the offer of [houses in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/beograd) and its surroundings or [houses in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja/novi-sad) and the places nearby. There are also [houses for rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje) long-term, and houses with a pool rented by the day for holidays and parties. You choose the type of offer in the filter, and the place and price narrow the choice so you can find cheap houses in the area that suits you.

Before buying, check the title deed, whether the house is registered or legalised and whether it has a building and occupancy permit, as a mortgage depends on it too. View the house in person and look at the roof, damp in the walls, the installations and the electricity, water and sewage connections. For village houses, ask about the road to the plot and the incentives the municipality or the state gives for buying a village house. A good ad states the house and plot area, the number of rooms, the heating and the year of construction.' WHERE slug = 'houses' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Kuće na prodaju](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja) i [za izdavanje](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje): kuće u gradu, seoske kuće i imanja, kuće sa [placem](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi) i pored reke, kao i kuće na dan. Pretražujte po gradu i opštini i uporedite cene u kraju koji vas zanima.

Pre kupovine proverite uknjiženost, građevinsku dozvolu i stanje krova, instalacija i temelja. Dobar oglas navodi površinu kuće i placa, broj prostorija, grejanje i priključke.' AND BINARY text_en = '[Houses for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/prodaja) and [rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce/izdavanje): town houses, village houses and farmsteads, houses with [land](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi) and by the river, and houses for daily rent. Search by city and municipality and compare prices in the area you want.

Before buying, check the registration, building permit and the state of the roof, utilities and foundations. A good ad states the house and plot area, the number of rooms, heating and connections.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na planinama za zimovanje i letnji odmor: apartmani, sobe, vikendice, brvnare i planinske kuće koje domaćini izdaju direktno, bez posrednika. Najviše ponuda ima na [Zlatiboru](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) i [Kopaoniku](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik), a mirniji odmor u prirodi nude [Tara](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara), [Divčibare](/oglasi/odmor/planine/divcibare) i [Stara planina](/oglasi/odmor/planine/stara-planina). Zimi se najviše traži smeštaj blizu ski staza i žičara, a leti kuće sa dvorištem, roštiljem i pogledom, za porodice i veća društva.

Pre rezervacije dogovorite tačne datume, cenu po noći i da li su u cenu uračunati boravišna taksa, grejanje i parking. Pitajte koliko je smeštaj udaljen od staza ili centra, kakav je put zimi i da li su potrebni lanci, i tražite fotografije soba i kupatila. Kapara se obično daje unapred, pa je uplatite tek kada se dogovorite oko svih uslova. Domaćini mogu besplatno da postave oglas, a broj gostiju i udaljenost od centra najbolje je navesti već u naslovu.', text_en = 'Mountain accommodation for winter and summer holidays: apartments, rooms, cottages, log cabins and mountain houses rented directly by their hosts, without agents. Most offers are on [Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) and [Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik), while [Tara](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara), [Divčibare](/oglasi/odmor/planine/divcibare) and [Stara Planina](/oglasi/odmor/planine/stara-planina) offer a quieter break in nature. In winter the most wanted places are close to the slopes and ski lifts, in summer houses with a yard, barbecue and a view, for families and larger groups.

Before booking, agree on the exact dates, the price per night and whether the tourist tax, heating and parking are included. Ask how far the place is from the slopes or the centre, what the road is like in winter and whether you need chains, and ask for photos of the rooms and bathroom. A deposit is usually paid in advance, so pay it only once you have agreed on all the terms. Hosts can post an ad for free, and the number of guests and distance from the centre are best stated right in the title.' WHERE slug = 'mountains' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Smeštaj na planinama: apartmani, sobe, vikendice i brvnare na [Zlatiboru](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor), [Kopaoniku](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik), [Tari](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara), [Divčibarama](/oglasi/odmor/planine/divcibare) i drugim planinama, za zimski i letnji odmor.

Pre rezervacije dogovorite datume, cenu po noći i udaljenost od staza ili centra i tražite fotografije. Domaćini izdaju direktno, bez posrednika.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Mountain accommodation: apartments, rooms, cottages and log cabins on [Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor), [Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik), [Tara](/oglasi/odmor/planine/tara), [Divčibare](/oglasi/odmor/planine/divcibare) and other mountains, for winter and summer holidays.

Before booking, agree on the dates, price per night and distance to the slopes or centre, and ask for photos. Hosts rent directly, without agents.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Televizori, novi i polovni, svih dijagonala: od malih od 32 inča za kuhinju i spavaću sobu do modela od 43, 50, 55 i 65 inča i većih za dnevnu sobu. U ponudi su Smart i Android televizori Samsung, LG, Sony, Philips, Hisense i TCL, kao i domaći Tesla, Vivax i Orion. U filteru birate televizore, risivere i TV box uređaje ili projektore, a uz njih se prodaju i nosači za zid, antene i daljinski upravljači.

Kod polovnog televizora pogledajte ekran na beloj i na tamnoj slici zbog mrtvih piksela, fleka i traka i proverite da li rade svi HDMI ulazi, WiFi i aplikacije koje koristite. Pitajte za godinu proizvodnje i da li ide uz račun ili garanciju, a veliki ekran prenosite uspravno, u originalnoj kutiji ako postoji. Prodavci neka navedu dijagonalu, rezoluciju i model. Za bolji zvuk pogledajte [zvučnike i kućne bioskope](/oglasi/elektronika/audio), a uz Smart TV često ide i [konzola za igranje](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice).', text_en = 'TVs, new and used, in every size: from small 32-inch sets for the kitchen and bedroom to 43, 50, 55 and 65-inch models and bigger ones for the living room. On offer are smart and Android TVs from Samsung, LG, Sony, Philips, Hisense and TCL, plus the local Tesla, Vivax and Orion. In the filter you choose TVs, receivers and TV boxes or projectors, and wall mounts, aerials and remote controls are sold alongside them.

With a used TV, look at the screen on a white and on a dark picture for dead pixels, blotches and lines, and check that all HDMI inputs, WiFi and the apps you use work. Ask about the year of manufacture and whether it comes with a receipt or warranty, and carry a big screen upright, in the original box if there is one. Sellers should state the screen size, resolution and model. For better sound see [speakers and home cinemas](/oglasi/elektronika/audio), and a smart TV often goes with a [games console](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice).' WHERE slug = 'tv' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Televizori, novi i polovni: Smart i LED televizori Samsung, LG, Tesla, Orion i drugih marki, svih dijagonala, kao i TV box uređaji, antene i risiveri.

Proverite da li ekran ima mrtve piksele ili tragove, da li daljinski radi i koje aplikacije televizor podržava. Prodavci neka navedu dijagonalu, rezoluciju i godinu proizvodnje. Uz televizor često idu i [zvučnici i audio oprema](/oglasi/elektronika/audio) ili [konzola za igranje](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice).' AND BINARY text_en = 'TVs, new and used: smart and LED TVs from Samsung, LG, Tesla, Orion and other brands in every size, plus TV boxes, aerials and receivers.

Check the screen for dead pixels or marks, that the remote works and which apps the TV supports. Sellers should state the screen size, resolution and year. A TV often goes together with [speakers and audio gear](/oglasi/elektronika/audio) or a [games console](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Slušalice, zvučnici i audio oprema, nova i polovna: [AirPods i druge bežične slušalice](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/slusalice), bluetooth slušalice za trčanje, gejming slušalice sa mikrofonom, prenosivi [bluetooth zvučnici](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/zvucnici) JBL, Marshall i Sony i karaoke zvučnici za žurke. Ljubitelji dobrog zvuka ovde nalaze [gramofone, ploče i pojačala](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi), zvučne kutije, risivere i kućne bioskope, a ima i auto audio opreme. Vrstu opreme birate u filteru.

Kod AirPods i drugih skupljih slušalica proverite da li su originalne: tražite račun ili kutiju sa serijskim brojem i uporedite ga sa brojem u podešavanjima telefona. Pitajte koliko dugo baterija drži i da li kutija za punjenje radi. Hi-fi opremu i gramofone najbolje je poslušati uživo, sa pločom ili pesmom koju dobro poznajete. U oglasu navedite model, starost i šta ide u kompletu, a uz kućni bioskop često se traže i [televizori](/oglasi/elektronika/televizori).', text_en = 'Headphones, speakers and audio gear, new and used: [AirPods and other wireless headphones](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/slusalice), Bluetooth headphones for running, gaming headsets with a microphone, portable [Bluetooth speakers](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/zvucnici) from JBL, Marshall and Sony, and karaoke speakers for parties. Fans of good sound will find [turntables, records and amplifiers](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi), loudspeakers, receivers and home cinemas here, plus car audio. You choose the type of gear in the filter.

With AirPods and other pricier headphones, check that they are genuine: ask for the receipt or the box with the serial number and compare it with the number in the phone''s settings. Ask how long the battery lasts and whether the charging case works. Hi-fi gear and turntables are best heard in person, with a record or a song you know well. In your ad, state the model, age and what is included, and people buying a home cinema often look for [TVs](/oglasi/elektronika/televizori) too.' WHERE slug = 'audio' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Slušalice, zvučnici i audio oprema: [AirPods i bežične slušalice](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/slusalice), [bluetooth zvučnici](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/zvucnici), kućni bioskopi, [gramofoni, pojačala i hi-fi komponente](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi).

Kod slušalica proverite da li su originalne i kako drži baterija, a kod hi-fi opreme poslušajte uređaj uživo. Navedite model i šta ide u kompletu.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Headphones, speakers and audio: [AirPods and wireless headphones](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/slusalice), [Bluetooth speakers](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/zvucnici), home cinemas, [turntables, amplifiers and hi-fi components](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi).

With headphones, check that they are genuine and how the battery holds up; with hi-fi gear, listen to it in person. State the model and what is included.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Konzole i video igre, nove i polovne: [PlayStation 5 i PlayStation 4](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/playstation) sa Slim i Pro modelima, [Nintendo Switch i Switch Lite](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/nintendo), Xbox konzole i retro konzole za kolekcionare. Veliki je izbor polovnih igrica za PS4 i PS5, od fudbala i trka do akcionih naslova, a tu su i džojstici, punjači, volani i druga oprema za igranje. Polovne konzole i igrice su mnogo povoljnije od novih, a vrstu konzole ili opreme birate u filteru.

Pre kupovine uključite konzolu i proverite da li se pregreva, da li ventilator bučno radi i da li čita diskove. Isprobajte džojstike, posebno analogne palice koje vremenom same pomeraju lik, i tražite da prodavac odjavi svoj nalog sa konzole. Prodavci neka navedu model, memoriju, broj džojstika i igrice koje idu uz konzolu. Za igranje na velikom ekranu pogledajte i ponudu [televizora](/oglasi/elektronika/televizori).', text_en = 'Consoles and video games, new and used: [PlayStation 5 and PlayStation 4](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/playstation) including the Slim and Pro models, [Nintendo Switch and Switch Lite](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/nintendo), Xbox consoles and retro consoles for collectors. There is a big choice of used PS4 and PS5 games, from football and racing to action titles, plus controllers, chargers, steering wheels and other gaming gear. Used consoles and games cost much less than new ones, and you choose the type of console or gear in the filter.

Before buying, switch the console on and check whether it overheats, whether the fan is noisy and whether it reads discs. Try the controllers, especially the analogue sticks, which in time start moving the character on their own, and ask the seller to sign their account out of the console. Sellers should state the model, storage, number of controllers and the games that come with the console. For playing on a big screen, see the offer of [TVs](/oglasi/elektronika/televizori) too.' WHERE slug = 'consoles' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Konzole i video igre: [PlayStation 5 i 4](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/playstation), [Nintendo Switch](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/nintendo), Xbox, igrice, džojstici i oprema. Polovne konzole i igrice su mnogo povoljnije od novih.

Proverite da li konzola radi bez pregrevanja i buke, da li džojstici rade ispravno i da li je nalog odjavljen. Prodavci neka navedu model, memoriju i šta ide uz konzolu.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Consoles and video games: [PlayStation 5 and 4](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/playstation), [Nintendo Switch](/oglasi/elektronika/konzole-i-igrice/nintendo), Xbox, games, controllers and accessories. Used consoles and games cost much less than new ones.

Check that the console runs without overheating or noise, that the controllers work properly and that the account is signed out. Sellers should state the model, storage and what comes with it.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Usisivači i paročistači za stan, kuću i radionicu: klasični usisivači sa kesom i usisivači sa posudom, [štapni i ručni usisivači](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/stapni-usisivaci) na baterije, robot usisivači, usisivači sa vodenim filterom i industrijski usisivači za radionicu i gradilište. Među [paročistačima](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/parocistaci) najviše se traže Kärcher modeli za podove i pločice, a tu su i ručni paročistači i parni brisači. U ponudi su i Bosch, Samsung, Gorenje, Dyson i druge marke, kao i usisivači za pepeo za kamine i peći. Vrstu aparata birate u filteru.

Kod polovnog usisivača proverite snagu usisavanja, stanje creva, četki i nastavaka i da li motor radi bez mirisa paljevine. Pitajte da li uz njega idu rezervne kese ili filteri i da li se još prodaju za taj model. Kod štapnih i robot usisivača najvažnija je baterija: pitajte koliko dugo radi na jedno punjenje i da li je menjana. Za druge aparate za kuću pogledajte [male kućne aparate](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati).', text_en = 'Vacuum cleaners and steam cleaners for the flat, the house and the workshop: classic bagged and bagless vacuums, cordless [stick and handheld vacuums](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/stapni-usisivaci), robot vacuums, water filter vacuums and industrial vacuums for workshops and building sites. Among [steam cleaners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/parocistaci), Kärcher models for floors and tiles are the most wanted, along with handheld steam cleaners and steam mops. Bosch, Samsung, Gorenje, Dyson and other brands are on offer too, as well as ash vacuums for fireplaces and stoves. You choose the type of appliance in the filter.

With a used vacuum, check the suction power, the hose, brushes and attachments, and that the motor runs without a burning smell. Ask whether spare bags or filters come with it and whether they are still sold for that model. With stick and robot vacuums the battery matters most: ask how long it runs on one charge and whether it has been replaced. For other appliances for the home, see [small appliances](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati).' WHERE slug = 'vacuums' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Usisivači i paročistači: [Kärcher i drugi paročistači](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/parocistaci), [štapni i ručni usisivači](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/stapni-usisivaci), usisivači sa vodenim filterom i robot usisivači.

Proverite snagu usisavanja, stanje creva i četki i da li ima rezervnih kesa ili filtera. Kod bežičnih modela pitajte koliko dugo baterija radi.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Vacuums and steam cleaners: [Kärcher and other steam cleaners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/parocistaci), [stick and handheld vacuums](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci/stapni-usisivaci), water filter vacuums and robot vacuums.

Check the suction power, the hose and brushes and whether spare bags or filters are included. For cordless models, ask how long the battery lasts.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Mali kućni aparati za kuhinju i domaćinstvo: [električni roštilji i gril aparati](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), roštilji na ćumur za dvorište, [pegle na paru, parne stanice i vertikalne pegle](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/pegle), putne pegle, [blenderi, štapni i ručni mikseri](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/blenderi-i-mikseri) i multipraktici. U ponudi su i friteze na vrući vazduh, tosteri, aparati za kafu, kuvala za vodu i sokovnici. Vrstu aparata birate u filteru, a mnogi se prodaju gotovo novi, jer su dobijeni na poklon ili korišćeni samo nekoliko puta.

Pre kupovine proverite da li aparat radi i da li ima sve nastavke, posude i poklopce, jer se delovi za starije modele teško nalaze. Kod pegle na paru pogledajte da li đon ima ogrebotine i da li iz njega curi kamenac, a kod miksera i blendera proverite noževe i da li motor radi tiho. Ako prodajete, navedite marku, model i snagu i fotografišite aparat sa svim delovima. Za veće aparate pogledajte [usisivače i paročistače](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci).', text_en = 'Small appliances for the kitchen and the household: [electric grills and contact grills](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), charcoal barbecues for the garden, [steam irons, steam generators and garment steamers](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/pegle), travel irons, [blenders, hand blenders and mixers](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/blenderi-i-mikseri) and food processors. Air fryers, toasters, coffee machines, kettles and juicers are on offer too. You choose the type of appliance in the filter, and many are sold almost new, received as a gift or used only a few times.

Before buying, check that the appliance works and has all its attachments, bowls and lids, as parts for older models are hard to find. With a steam iron, check the soleplate for scratches and whether limescale comes out of it; with mixers and blenders, check the blades and that the motor runs quietly. If you are selling, state the brand, model and power and photograph the appliance with all its parts. For bigger appliances, see [vacuum and steam cleaners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci).' WHERE slug = 'small-appliances' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Mali kućni aparati: [roštilji i gril aparati](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), [pegle i parne stanice](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/pegle), [blenderi, mikseri i multipraktici](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/blenderi-i-mikseri), friteze i aparati za kuvanje.

Proverite da li aparat radi i da li ima sve nastavke. Mnogi mali aparati se prodaju gotovo novi, dobijeni na poklon.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Small appliances: [grills](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), [irons and steam stations](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/pegle), [blenders, mixers and food processors](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/blenderi-i-mikseri), air fryers and cookers.

Check that the appliance works and has all its attachments. Many small appliances are sold almost new, received as gifts.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Rasveta za stan, kuću i dvorište: [lusteri i plafonjere](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere) za dnevnu sobu, spavaću sobu i trpezariju, visilice, [LED plafonjere, sijalice i trake](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/led-rasveta), [podne i stone lampe](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/podne-i-stone-lampe), zidne lampe i spoljna rasveta. Za dvorište se traže reflektori, solarne lampe i sijalice za baštu, a za dnevnu sobu kombinacija lustera i podne lampe za čitanje. Vrstu rasvete birate u filteru, a polovni lusteri i lampe često su dizajnerski komadi po ceni mnogo nižoj od nove.

Pre kupovine proverite tip grla i snagu sijalica koje rasveta koristi i da li je LED modul ugrađen ili se sijalice menjaju. Kod lustera izmerite visinu prostorije i pitajte za težinu i dužinu lanca ili sajle, a kod spoljne rasvete proverite stepen zaštite od vode. Ugradnju lustera prepustite električaru. Uz novu rasvetu često se menjaju i [sofe i garniture](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture).', text_en = 'Lighting for the flat, the house and the garden: [chandeliers and ceiling lights](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere) for the living room, bedroom and dining room, pendant lights, [LED ceiling lights, bulbs and strips](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/led-rasveta), [floor and table lamps](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/podne-i-stone-lampe), wall lamps and outdoor lighting. For the garden people look for floodlights, solar lamps and garden bulbs, and for the living room a chandelier together with a floor lamp for reading. You choose the type of lighting in the filter, and used chandeliers and lamps are often designer pieces at a price far below a new one.

Before buying, check the socket type and wattage of the bulbs it takes and whether the LED module is built in or the bulbs can be changed. For a chandelier, measure the height of the room and ask about the weight and the length of the chain or cable; for outdoor lights, check the water protection rating. Leave fitting a chandelier to an electrician. New lighting often comes together with new [sofas and suites](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture).' WHERE slug = 'lighting' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Lusteri i plafonjere](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere), [LED sijalice i trake](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/led-rasveta), [podne i stone lampe](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/podne-i-stone-lampe), zidne lampe i spoljna rasveta za stan, kuću i dvorište.

Proverite tip grla i snagu sijalica, a kod lustera visinu i težinu. LED rasveta troši manje struje, pa se isplati i kod polovne opreme.' AND BINARY text_en = '[Chandeliers and ceiling lights](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere), [LED bulbs and strips](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/led-rasveta), [floor and table lamps](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/podne-i-stone-lampe), wall lamps and outdoor lighting for flats, houses and gardens.

Check the socket type and bulb wattage, and for chandeliers the drop and weight. LED lighting uses less power, which pays off even with second-hand fittings.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = '[Kreveti](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/kreveti) za svaku sobu: bračni i boks kreveti, kreveti samci i singl kreveti za jednu osobu, kreveti na rasklapanje, drveni i metalni kreveti, kao i kreveti sa fiokama za odlaganje posteljine. Uz njih se prodaju [dušeci](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/duseci) najčešćih dimenzija, 160x200, 140x200 i 90x200, memorijski i dušeci sa oprugama, nadmadraci, jastuci i letvice za krevet. Vrstu birate u filteru, a polovni kreveti iz uvoza i gotovo novi dušeci često su mnogo povoljniji od novih.

Pre kupovine izmerite prostor i proverite dimenzije kreveta i dušeka, jer dušek mora tačno da legne u okvir. Kod kreveta pogledajte letvice, spojeve i da li se rastavlja za prevoz, a kod dušeka pitajte za starost, tvrdoću i da li ima navlaku koja se pere. U oglasu navedite dimenzije, materijal i boju. Dečije krevete i krevete na sprat potražite u rubrici [dečiji nameštaj](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj), a posteljinu i jorgane među oglasima za [tepihe, zavese i posteljinu](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil).', text_en = '[Beds](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/kreveti) for every room: double and box spring beds, single beds, folding beds, wooden and metal beds, and beds with drawers for storing bedding. Sold alongside them are [mattresses](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/duseci) in the most common sizes, 160x200, 140x200 and 90x200, memory foam and spring mattresses, toppers, pillows and bed slats. You choose the type in the filter, and imported used beds and almost new mattresses often cost much less than new ones.

Before buying, measure the space and check the size of the bed and mattress, as the mattress has to fit the frame exactly. With a bed, look at the slats and joints and whether it comes apart for transport; with a mattress, ask about its age, firmness and whether it has a washable cover. In your ad, state the size, material and colour. Look for children''s beds and bunk beds under [children''s furniture](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj), and for bedding and duvets among the ads for [rugs, curtains and bedding](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil).' WHERE slug = 'beds' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Kreveti i dušeci: [bračni i boks kreveti](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/kreveti), kreveti samci i na rasklapanje, [dušeci i jastuci](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/duseci).

Proverite dimenzije kreveta i dušeka, stanje letvica i da li se krevet rastavlja za prevoz. Za dušeke pitajte za starost i tvrdoću. Krevetce i krevete na sprat potražite u rubrici [dečiji nameštaj](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Beds and mattresses: [double and box-spring beds](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/kreveti), single and folding beds, [mattresses and pillows](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci/duseci).

Check the bed and mattress dimensions, the slats and whether the bed comes apart for transport. For mattresses, ask about age and firmness. For cots and bunk beds, see the [kids'' furniture](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj) section.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Tekstil za dom: [tepisi i tepih staze](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/tepisi-i-staze) na metar, okrugli tepisi, sintelon tepisi i veliki tepisi za dnevnu sobu, vuneni ćilimi i persijski tepisi, kao i tepisi za terasu. Tu su i [posteljina i jorgani](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/posteljina-i-jorgani) za bračni krevet i samce, damast i pamučna posteljina, prekrivači, jastuci i ćebad, zatim zavese, draperije i garnišne za svaku prostoriju. Vrstu tekstila birate u filteru.

Kod tepiha navedite dimenzije, materijal i visinu flora i fotografišite ga sa obe strane, jer se na naličju vide oštećenja i popravke. Kupac neka pita da li je tepih opran i da li je bio u stanu sa kućnim ljubimcima ili pušačima. Za posteljinu su važne dimenzije, na primer 160x200 ili 200x220, sastav tkanine i da li je nova u pakovanju. Zavese merite po širini garnišne i visini od garnišne do poda, a uz nov tekstil često se kupuju i [kreveti i dušeci](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci).', text_en = 'Home textiles: [rugs and runners](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/tepisi-i-staze) by the metre, round rugs, Sintelon rugs and large living room rugs, woollen kilims and Persian rugs, plus rugs for the terrace. There is also [bedding and duvets](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/posteljina-i-jorgani) for double and single beds, damask and cotton bed linen, bedspreads, pillows and blankets, and curtains, drapes and curtain rails for every room. You choose the type of textile in the filter.

For a rug, state the size, material and pile height and photograph it on both sides, as damage and repairs show on the back. Buyers should ask whether the rug has been washed and whether it was in a home with pets or smokers. For bedding, the size matters, for example 160x200 or 200x220, along with the fabric and whether it is new in its packaging. Measure curtains by the width of the rail and the height from the rail to the floor, and new textiles are often bought together with [beds and mattresses](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci).' WHERE slug = 'textiles' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Tepisi i staze](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/tepisi-i-staze), [posteljina i jorgani](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/posteljina-i-jorgani), zavese i garnišne za svaki prostor.

Navedite dimenzije, materijal i stanje. Tepihe je dobro fotografisati sa obe strane.' AND BINARY text_en = '[Rugs and runners](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/tepisi-i-staze), [bedding and duvets](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/posteljina-i-jorgani), curtains and rails for every room.

State the dimensions, material and condition. Photograph rugs from both sides.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Stolovi i stolice za dom i kancelariju: [trpezarijski stolovi i stolice](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/trpezarijski-stolovi-i-stolice), okrugli i mali trpezarijski stolovi, stolovi na razvlačenje i rasklapanje, kao i kompleti stola sa stolicama za kuhinju. Tu su i [barske stolice](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/barske-stolice) za kuhinjsko ostrvo i šank, drvene, plastične i sklopive stolice, tonet stolice i stolice na ljuljanje, klub stolovi za dnevnu sobu i kancelarijski stolovi i stolice za rad od kuće. Vrstu birate u filteru, a polovni stolovi iz uvoza često su od punog drveta.

Pre kupovine izmerite prostor: oko trpezarijskog stola treba ostaviti dovoljno mesta da se stolice izvuku i da se prođe. Proverite površinu, ogrebotine i fleke, da li se noge klimaju i kako radi mehanizam za razvlačenje. Kod kancelarijskih stolica pogledajte točkiće i podešavanje visine i naslona. U oglasu navedite dimenzije, materijal i broj stolica. Uz trpezariju se često kupuju i [lusteri](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere) i [tepisi](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/tepisi-i-staze).', text_en = 'Tables and chairs for the home and the office: [dining tables and chairs](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/trpezarijski-stolovi-i-stolice), round and small dining tables, extending and folding tables, and kitchen table and chair sets. There are also [bar stools](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/barske-stolice) for the kitchen island and the bar, wooden, plastic and folding chairs, bentwood chairs and rocking chairs, coffee tables for the living room, and office desks and chairs for working from home. You choose the type in the filter, and imported used tables are often solid wood.

Before buying, measure the space: around a dining table you need enough room to pull the chairs out and walk past. Check the surface for scratches and stains, whether the legs wobble and how the extending mechanism works. With office chairs, look at the castors and the height and backrest adjustment. In your ad, state the size, material and number of chairs. A dining set is often bought together with [chandeliers](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta/lusteri-i-plafonjere) and [rugs](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil/tepisi-i-staze).' WHERE slug = 'tables-chairs' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Trpezarijski stolovi i stolice](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/trpezarijski-stolovi-i-stolice), [barske stolice](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/barske-stolice), kancelarijske i gaming stolice i stolovi na rasklapanje.

Proverite dimenzije stola, broj stolica i stanje površine i nogu.' AND BINARY text_en = '[Dining tables and chairs](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/trpezarijski-stolovi-i-stolice), [bar stools](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice/barske-stolice), office and gaming chairs and extending tables.

Check the table dimensions, the number of chairs and the condition of the top and legs.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sobna vrata, nova i polovna: drvena, medijapan i PVC sobna vrata, vrata za kupatilo, klizna i harmonika vrata, kao i ulazna vrata za kuće i stanove, sigurnosna, PVC i aluminijumska. Uz njih se prodaju garažna vrata, sekcijska i rolo vrata, spoljne roletne i komarnici za prozore i vrata. Ima i polovnih vrata iz uvoza i vrata koja su ostala posle renoviranja, po cenama znatno nižim od novih. Vrstu vrata birate u filteru, a za standardne mere i vrata po meri navedite dimenzije u oglasu, na primer 90x200.

Pre kupovine izmerite otvor u zidu, širinu štoka i debljinu zida i proverite smer otvaranja, levo ili desno. Kod ulaznih vrata pitajte za bravu i cilindar, broj tačaka zaključavanja i izolaciju, a kod polovnih proverite da li krilo dobro naleže i da li je okov ceo. Pitajte da li cena uključuje ugradnju, štok i kvake. Prozore i balkonska vrata potražite u rubrici [PVC i ALU stolarija](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija), a za ugradnju i bravarske radove pozovite [majstore](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Interior doors, new and used: wooden, MDF and PVC interior doors, bathroom doors, sliding and folding doors, plus front doors for houses and flats, security, PVC and aluminium ones. Sold alongside them are garage doors, sectional and roller doors, outdoor roller shutters and insect screens for windows and doors. There are also imported used doors and doors left over after renovations, at prices well below new ones. You choose the type of door in the filter, and for standard and made-to-measure doors, state the size in the ad, for example 90x200.

Before buying, measure the opening in the wall, the frame width and the wall thickness and check the opening direction, left or right. With front doors, ask about the lock and cylinder, the number of locking points and the insulation; with used ones, check that the leaf closes tightly and that the fittings are complete. Ask whether the price includes fitting, the frame and the handles. Look for windows and balcony doors under [PVC and aluminium joinery](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija), and for fitting and locksmith work call [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE slug = 'doors' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Sobna i ulazna vrata, sigurnosna vrata, roletne, komarnici i garažna vrata, nova i polovna, standardnih dimenzija i po meri.

Izmerite otvor pre kupovine i proverite smer otvaranja i širinu štoka. Pitajte da li cena uključuje ugradnju i okov. Prozore i balkonska vrata potražite u rubrici [PVC i ALU stolarija](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija), a za ugradnju pozovite [majstore](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Interior and front doors, security doors, roller shutters, insect screens and garage doors, new and used, standard sizes and made to measure.

Measure the opening before buying and check the opening direction and frame width. Ask whether the price includes fitting and hardware. For windows and balcony doors see [PVC and aluminium windows](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija), and for the fitting call in [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Grejanje za kuću i stan: [kotlovi na pelet, drva i čvrsto gorivo](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi), kombinovani kotlovi na drva i pelet, električni i gasni kotlovi, [peći na drva i pelet](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/peci-na-drva-i-pelet), šporeti na drva i kamini. Za centralno grejanje tu su [panelni radijatori](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/radijatori) i radijatori za kupatilo, a za dogrevanje radijatori i grejalice na struju. Vrstu birate u filteru, a ponuda polovnih kotlova i peći najveća je pred grejnu sezonu, kada mnogi prelaze na drugi energent.

Snagu kotla ili peći birajte prema površini koju grejete i izolaciji kuće: prodavac neka navede snagu u kilovatima, a vi pitajte za koliko kvadrata je uređaj namenjen. Kod polovnog kotla pogledajte ložište i izmenjivač zbog korozije i pukotina, pitajte za godinu proizvodnje i da li ima automatiku i pumpu. Radijatorima proverite dimenzije, broj članaka i priključke. Za montažu centralnog grejanja angažujte [majstore](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), a toplotu u kući sačuvaćete uz [stiropor, vunu i fasadu](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada).', text_en = 'Heating for the house and the flat: [pellet, wood and solid fuel boilers](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi), combined wood and pellet boilers, electric and gas boilers, [wood and pellet stoves](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/peci-na-drva-i-pelet), wood-burning cookers and fireplaces. For central heating there are [panel radiators](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/radijatori) and bathroom radiators, and for extra heat electric radiators and heaters. You choose the type in the filter, and the offer of used boilers and stoves is biggest before the heating season, when many people switch to another fuel.

Choose the power of a boiler or stove by the area you heat and the insulation of the house: the seller should state the power in kilowatts, and you should ask how many square metres the unit is meant for. With a used boiler, look at the firebox and heat exchanger for rust and cracks, and ask about the year of manufacture and whether it has controls and a pump. For radiators, check the size, the number of sections and the connections. Hire [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori) to install central heating, and keep the heat in the house with [polystyrene, wool and facade](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada).' WHERE slug = 'heating' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Kotlovi na pelet i drva](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi), [peći na drva](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/peci-na-drva-i-pelet), kamini i [radijatori](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/radijatori) za kuću i stan, novi i polovni.

Pre kupovine proverite snagu kotla ili peći u odnosu na površinu koju grejete, stanje ložišta i dimovodnog priključka. Za montažu centralnog grejanja angažujte [majstora](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' AND BINARY text_en = '[Pellet and wood boilers](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi), [wood stoves](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/peci-na-drva-i-pelet), fireplaces and [radiators](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/radijatori) for houses and flats, new and used.

Before buying, match the boiler or stove output to the area you heat, and check the firebox and flue connection. Hire [a professional](/oglasi/usluge/majstori) to install central heating.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'PVC stolarija i ALU stolarija: PVC prozori sa roletnama i bez njih, balkonska vrata, PVC ulazna vrata, aluminijumski prozori i izlozi, drveni prozori i krovni prozori za potkrovlje. Pored nove stolarije po meri ima i polovne PVC stolarije i prozora skinutih pri renoviranju, koji su dobar izbor za vikendice, pomoćne objekte i garaže. Uz prozore se prodaju komarnici, roletne, podprozorske daske i okovi, a ponuda obuhvata i PVC i aluminijumske ograde za terase.

Pre kupovine izmerite otvore u zidu i uporedite ih sa dimenzijama prozora, na primer 180x140, jer se polovna stolarija retko može skratiti. Proverite broj komora profila, vrstu i broj stakala, stanje dihtunga i da li okov otvara krilo i na kip. Pitajte da li cena novih prozora uključuje ugradnju i odvoz starih. Uz stolariju pogledajte i [sobna i ulazna vrata](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/vrata), [stiropor, vunu i fasadu](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada) za izolaciju kuće i [majstore](/oglasi/usluge/majstori) za ugradnju.', text_en = 'PVC and aluminium joinery: PVC windows with or without roller shutters, balcony doors, PVC front doors, aluminium windows and shop fronts, wooden windows and roof windows for the attic. Besides new made-to-measure joinery there are used PVC windows and windows taken out during renovations, a good choice for weekend houses, outbuildings and garages. Insect screens, roller shutters, window sills and fittings are sold alongside, and the offer also includes PVC and aluminium railings for terraces.

Before buying, measure the openings in the wall and compare them with the window size, for example 180x140, as used windows can rarely be cut down. Check the number of chambers in the profile, the type and number of panes, the seals and whether the fittings also tilt the sash. Ask whether the price of new windows includes fitting and taking away the old ones. Along with joinery, see [interior and front doors](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/vrata), [polystyrene, wool and facade](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada) for insulating the house and [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori) for fitting.' WHERE slug = 'windows' AND BINARY text_sr = 'PVC i ALU stolarija: prozori, balkonska vrata, polovna stolarija i prozori po meri, sa roletnama ili bez.

Izmerite otvore i proverite broj komora profila, vrstu stakla i okov. Kod polovne stolarije pitajte za dimenzije i stanje dihtunga. Uz stolariju pogledajte i [sobna i ulazna vrata](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/vrata) i [stiropor, vunu i fasadu](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada) za izolaciju kuće.' AND BINARY text_en = 'PVC and aluminium windows: windows, balcony doors, used joinery and made-to-measure windows, with or without shutters.

Measure the openings and check the number of profile chambers, the glazing and the hardware. For used windows, ask about the dimensions and the state of the seals. Alongside windows, see [interior and front doors](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/vrata) and [insulation and facade materials](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada) for the house.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Materijal za izolaciju i završne radove: stiropor i stirodur u pločama različite debljine, kamena i staklena vuna, [fasada, lepak i mrežica za stiropor](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada/fasada-i-lepkovi) za demit fasadu, fasadne ciglice, kao i ukrasni i dekorativni stiropor, lajsne i ploče za plafon. Tu su i gips ploče, profili i spušteni plafoni, boje za zidove i fasadu i tapete. Vrstu materijala birate u filteru, a ostaci posle gradnje i višak sa gradilišta često se prodaju povoljno.

Debljinu i gustinu izolacije birajte prema nameni: za fasadu se najčešće uzima stiropor ili kamena vuna, a za podove, podrume i temelje stirodur, koji ne upija vodu. Izračunajte potrebnu količinu prema površini i dodajte rezervu za sečenje, a za veće količine dogovorite dostavu. Kod kamene vune pitajte da li je čuvana na suvom. Kad izolujete kuću, pogledajte i [PVC i ALU stolariju](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija), [kotlove, peći i radijatore](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje) i [građevinski materijal](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal).', text_en = 'Materials for insulation and finishing work: EPS and XPS boards of various thicknesses, rock and glass wool, [facade, adhesives and mesh](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada/fasada-i-lepkovi) for an ETICS facade, facade brick slips, plus decorative polystyrene, mouldings and ceiling tiles. There are also plasterboard, profiles and suspended ceilings, wall and facade paints, and wallpaper. You choose the type of material in the filter, and leftovers after building and surplus from building sites are often sold cheaply.

Choose the thickness and density of the insulation by its use: facades usually get EPS or rock wool, while floors, basements and foundations get XPS, which does not soak up water. Work out the amount you need from the area and add a reserve for cutting, and arrange delivery for larger amounts. With rock wool, ask whether it was kept dry. When insulating a house, see [PVC and aluminium joinery](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija), [boilers, stoves and radiators](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje) and [building materials](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal) too.' WHERE slug = 'insulation' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Stiropor i stirodur, kamena i staklena vuna, [fasada i lepkovi](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada/fasada-i-lepkovi), gips ploče i paneli za izolaciju i završne radove.

Proverite debljinu i gustinu ploča i potrebnu količinu za vašu površinu, a za veće količine dogovorite dostavu. Ostaci materijala posle gradnje često se prodaju povoljno. Kad izolujete kuću, pogledajte i [PVC i ALU stolariju](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija) i [kotlove, peći i radijatore](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje).' AND BINARY text_en = 'EPS and XPS boards, mineral and glass wool, [render and adhesives](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada/fasada-i-lepkovi), plasterboard and panels for insulation and finishing.

Check the board thickness and density and the quantity you need, and arrange delivery for larger orders. Leftover material after a build is often sold cheaply. When insulating a house, also look at [PVC and aluminium windows](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija) and [boilers, stoves and radiators](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ograde i kapije za dvorište, plac i terasu: panelne ograde i paneli za ogradu, žičane ograde i mreža za ogradu, metalne i kovane ograde, betonske ograde i stubovi, drvene i WPC ograde, kao i gotove ograde za dvorište. Za terase i stepeništa traže se aluminijumske, staklene i metalne ograde, a za privatnost veštačka živa ograda, trska i zaštitne mreže. Uz njih se prodaju klizne i krilne kapije, metalne kapije za dvorište, pešačke kapije i automatika za kapije.

Pre kupovine izmerite dužinu i visinu ograde i broj stubova, i pitajte da li cena uključuje stubove, okov, šrafove i montažu. Kod metalnih ograda i kapija proverite da li su pocinkovane ili plastificirane, jer od toga zavisi koliko će trajati bez rđe. Za postavljanje ograde i betoniranje stubova potražite [majstore](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), a cement, pesak i armaturu u rubrici [građevinski materijal](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal). Za uređenje dvorišta pogledajte i [baštenski nameštaj](/oglasi/namestaj/bastenski-namestaj).', text_en = 'Fences and gates for the yard, the plot and the terrace: panel fences and fence panels, wire fences and fence mesh, metal and wrought iron fences, concrete fences and posts, wooden and WPC fences, and ready-made garden fences. For terraces and staircases people look for aluminium, glass and metal railings, and for privacy artificial hedges, reed screens and shade nets. Sliding and swing gates, metal yard gates, pedestrian gates and gate automation are sold alongside.

Before buying, measure the length and height of the fence and the number of posts, and ask whether the price includes posts, fittings, screws and installation. With metal fences and gates, check whether they are galvanised or powder-coated, as that decides how long they last without rust. For putting up the fence and concreting the posts, find [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), and cement, sand and rebar under [building materials](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal). For doing up the yard, see [garden furniture](/oglasi/namestaj/bastenski-namestaj) too.' WHERE slug = 'fences' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Ograde i kapije za dvorište: panelne i metalne ograde, kovane ograde, kapije, betonski stubovi i pletiva.

Izmerite dužinu ograde i visinu, i pitajte da li cena uključuje stubove, okov i montažu. Za postavljanje ograde potražite [majstore](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), a cement, pesak i armaturu u rubrici [građevinski materijal](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Fences and gates for your yard: panel and metal fences, wrought-iron fences, gates, concrete posts and wire mesh.

Measure the fence length and height, and ask whether the price includes posts, hardware and installation. To put the fence up, find [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori); cement, sand and rebar are under [building materials](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sve za kupatilo: [tuš kabine](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/tus-kabine) za mala i velika kupatila, kabine 80x80 i 90x90 i kabine po meri, tuš kade, paravani i stakla za tuš kabinu, kao i kade i hidromasažne kade. Tu su i [WC šolje](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/wc-solje), monoblok i viseće, vodokotlići, umivaonici i nadgradni lavaboi, slavine i baterije, ormarići, ogledala i rasveta za kupatilo. Vrstu sanitarija birate u filteru, a višak sa gradilišta i nekorišćene sanitarije posle renoviranja često se prodaju po nižoj ceni.

Pre kupovine izmerite prostor i proverite gde su priključci za vodu i odvod: kod WC šolje je važno da li odvod ide u zid ili u pod, a kod tuš kabine visina kade i strana na koju se otvaraju vrata. Kod paravana i stakala pitajte da li je staklo kaljeno i kolike je debljine. Polovne sanitarije pregledajte zbog pukotina i oštećene gleđi. Za zidove i pod pogledajte [pločice i keramiku](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/keramika), a za ugradnju [vodoinstalatere i druge majstore](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Everything for the bathroom: [shower cabins](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/tus-kabine) for small and large bathrooms, 80x80 and 90x90 and made-to-measure cabins, shower trays, screens and shower glass, plus bathtubs and whirlpool baths. There are also [toilets](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/wc-solje), close-coupled and wall-hung, cisterns, washbasins and countertop basins, taps and mixers, cabinets, mirrors and bathroom lighting. You choose the type of sanitary ware in the filter, and surplus from building sites and unused fittings left after a renovation are often sold for less.

Before buying, measure the space and check where the water and drain connections are: with a toilet it matters whether the outlet goes into the wall or the floor, with a shower cabin the height of the tray and the side the door opens to. For screens and glass, ask whether the glass is tempered and how thick it is. Inspect used sanitary ware for cracks and damaged glaze. For walls and floors, see [tiles and ceramics](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/keramika), and for fitting, [plumbers and other tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE slug = 'bathroom' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Tuš kabine i kade](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/tus-kabine), [WC šolje i lavaboi](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/wc-solje), slavine, ormarići i ogledala za kupatilo.

Izmerite prostor i proverite priključke za vodu i odvod pre kupovine. Za zidove i pod kupatila pogledajte i [pločice i keramiku](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/keramika).' AND BINARY text_en = '[Shower cabins and bathtubs](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/tus-kabine), [toilets and basins](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/wc-solje), taps, cabinets and mirrors for the bathroom.

Measure your space and check the water and drain connections before buying. For the bathroom walls and floor, see [tiles and ceramics](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/keramika) as well.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ručni i električni alati za majstore i za kućnu upotrebu: [ugaone brusilice i testere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/brusilice-i-testere), cirkulari, ubodne testere i glodalice za drvo, [bušilice, udarni i aku odvijači](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/busilice-i-odvijaci), hilti bušilice i štemarice, kao i [aparati za varenje](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/aparati-za-varenje), inverteri i CO2 aparati. Tu su i ručni alat, garniture ključeva i kutije za alat, skele i merdevine, a najviše oglasa ima za Bosch, Makita i Parkside alat. Alat na baterije često se prodaje u kompletu sa punjačem i više baterija, a vrstu alata birate u filteru.

Kod polovnog alata proverite da li radi pod opterećenjem, kakvo je stanje kabla, četkica i ležajeva i da li se motor pregreva. Kod aku alata najvažnija je baterija: pitajte koliko je stara, koliko drži i da li odgovara drugim alatima iste marke. Aparat za varenje isprobajte uživo i pitajte za jačinu struje i kablove. Prodavci neka navedu marku, snagu i šta je u kompletu. Pumpe za vodu i agregate naći ćete u rubrici [agregati i pumpe](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe).', text_en = 'Hand and power tools for tradesmen and for home use: [angle grinders and saws](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/brusilice-i-testere), circular saws, jigsaws and wood routers, [drills, impact drivers and cordless screwdrivers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/busilice-i-odvijaci), rotary hammers and demolition hammers, plus [welding machines](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/aparati-za-varenje), inverters and MIG welders. There are also hand tools, spanner sets and toolboxes, scaffolding and ladders, and most ads are for Bosch, Makita and Parkside tools. Cordless tools are often sold as a kit with a charger and several batteries, and you choose the type of tool in the filter.

With used tools, check that they work under load, the state of the cable, brushes and bearings, and whether the motor overheats. With cordless tools the battery matters most: ask how old it is, how long it lasts and whether it fits other tools of the same brand. Try a welding machine in person and ask about the current range and the cables. Sellers should state the brand, power and what is included. Water pumps and generators are in the [generators and pumps](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe) section.' WHERE slug = 'power-tools' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Ručni i električni alati: [brusilice i testere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/brusilice-i-testere), [aparati za varenje](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/aparati-za-varenje), [bušilice i odvijači](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/busilice-i-odvijaci), skele i merdevine i ostali alat za majstore i kućnu upotrebu.

Kod polovnog alata proverite da li radi, stanje kabla i baterije i da li ima punjač. Prodavci neka navedu marku, snagu i šta je u kompletu.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Hand and power tools: [grinders and saws](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/brusilice-i-testere), [welders](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/aparati-za-varenje), [drills and drivers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati/busilice-i-odvijaci), scaffolding and ladders and other tools for tradesmen and home use.

With used tools, check that they work, the cable and battery, and that a charger is included. Sellers should state the brand, power and what is in the set.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovni traktori domaćih i stranih marki: [IMT](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/imt) 533, 539, 558 i 577, [Belarus](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/belarus), [Zetor](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/zetor), [Torpedo](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/torpedo) i Rakovica, kao i John Deere, Massey Ferguson, New Holland, Deutz i drugi zapadni traktori. Marku birate u filteru, a filter po ceni brzo izdvaja jeftinije traktore za manja imanja. Uz traktore se prodaju prikolice jednoosovinke i dvoosovinke, traktorske kosilice i delovi za traktore.

Pre kupovine proverite saobraćajnu dozvolu i registraciju, broj radnih sati i stanje motora, menjača, kvačila i hidraulike, pa traktor upalite hladan i dogovorite probnu vožnju. Pogledajte i gume, kardan i priključno vratilo i pitajte da li je traktor bio u stalnoj upotrebi ili je duže stajao. Prodavci neka navedu snagu, godište i opremu, na primer kabinu ili pogon na sva četiri točka. Plugove, tanjirače, sejalice i prskalice naći ćete u rubrici [poljoprivredne mašine](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).', text_en = 'Used tractors of local and foreign makes: [IMT](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/imt) 533, 539, 558 and 577, [Belarus](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/belarus), [Zetor](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/zetor), [Torpedo](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/torpedo) and Rakovica, plus John Deere, Massey Ferguson, New Holland, Deutz and other western tractors. You choose the make in the filter, and the price filter quickly picks out cheaper tractors for smaller farms. Single and twin-axle trailers, ride-on mowers and tractor parts are sold alongside.

Before buying, check the registration certificate and plates, the engine hours and the state of the engine, gearbox, clutch and hydraulics, start the tractor from cold and arrange a test drive. Look at the tyres, the drive shaft and the PTO too, and ask whether the tractor was in constant use or stood idle for a long time. Sellers should state the power, year and equipment, for example a cab or four-wheel drive. Ploughs, disc harrows, seed drills and sprayers are in the [farm machinery](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine) section.' WHERE slug = 'tractors' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Polovni traktori: [IMT](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/imt), [Belarus](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/belarus), [Zetor](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/zetor), [Torpedo](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/torpedo), John Deere i druge marke, kao i delovi za traktore.

Pre kupovine proverite papire i registraciju, broj radnih sati, stanje motora, menjača i hidraulike i dogovorite probnu vožnju. Prodavci neka navedu snagu, godište i opremu. Plugove, tanjirače i druge priključke naći ćete u rubrici [poljoprivredne mašine](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Used tractors: [IMT](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/imt), [Belarus](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/belarus), [Zetor](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/zetor), [Torpedo](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori/torpedo), John Deere and other makes, plus tractor parts.

Before buying, check the papers and registration, the working hours, the engine, gearbox and hydraulics, and arrange a test drive. Sellers should state the power, year and equipment. Ploughs, disc harrows and other implements are under [farm machinery](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sadnice i rasad iz rasadnika i od privatnih proizvođača: [voćne sadnice](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice) jabuke, šljive, kruške, trešnje i oraha, stubasto voće za male bašte, sadnice maline, kupine i borovnice i frigo sadnice jagoda. Za povrtnjak tu su [rasad paradajza, paprike i drugog povrća i seme](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/rasad-i-seme), a za dvorište ukrasno bilje: tuje i lejlandi za živu ogradu, fotinija, hortenzije, ruže puzavice, paulovnija i sobno cveće. Vrstu biljaka birate u filteru.

Pre kupovine pitajte za sortu, podlogu i starost sadnice i da li je sertifikovana i zdrava, posebno kod malina i jagoda za plantažni uzgoj. Voćne sadnice sa golim korenom sade se u jesen i rano proleće, a sadnice u saksiji gotovo tokom cele godine, pa se raspitajte i za najbolje vreme sadnje. Rasad povrća birajte zdrav i čvrst, bez žutog lišća. Rasadnici i proizvođači mogu besplatno da postave oglas sa cenama i načinom isporuke, a alat za baštu potražite u rubrici [kosilice i trimeri](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri).', text_en = 'Seedlings and young plants from nurseries and private growers: [fruit trees](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice) such as apple, plum, pear, cherry and walnut, columnar fruit trees for small gardens, raspberry, blackberry and blueberry plants and frigo strawberry plants. For the vegetable patch there are [tomato, pepper and other vegetable seedlings and seeds](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/rasad-i-seme), and for the garden ornamental plants: thujas and leylandii for hedges, photinia, hydrangeas, climbing roses, paulownia and house plants. You choose the type of plant in the filter.

Before buying, ask about the variety, rootstock and age of the plant and whether it is certified and healthy, especially with raspberries and strawberries for plantations. Bare-root fruit trees are planted in autumn and early spring, potted ones almost all year round, so ask about the best time to plant too. Choose vegetable seedlings that are healthy and sturdy, without yellow leaves. Nurseries and growers can post an ad for free with prices and delivery options, and garden tools are in the [mowers and trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri) section.' WHERE slug = 'plants' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Voćne sadnice](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice), [rasad povrća i seme](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/rasad-i-seme), tuje i ukrasno bilje iz rasadnika i od privatnih proizvođača.

Pitajte za sortu, podlogu i starost sadnice i najbolje vreme sadnje. Rasadnici mogu besplatno da oglase ponudu sa cenama.' AND BINARY text_en = '[Fruit tree seedlings](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice), [vegetable seedlings and seeds](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/rasad-i-seme), thujas and ornamental plants from nurseries and private growers.

Ask about the variety, rootstock and age of the seedling and the best time to plant. Nurseries can advertise their range with prices for free.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Domaće životinje na prodaju od uzgajivača i domaćinstava iz cele Srbije: [prasići i svinje](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/svinje-i-prasici) za tov i priplod, [krave, junice i telad](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/krave-i-telad), [ovce i koze](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/ovce-i-koze), uključujući romanovske i druge rase, [konji](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/konji) za rad, jahanje i sport i [živina](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/zivina): pilići, kokoške nosilje, ćurke, patke i guske. Vrstu životinje birate u filteru, a filter po mestu pokazuje ponude u blizini, što je važno zbog prevoza.

Pre kupovine pitajte za starost, rasu i težinu, način ishrane i zdravstveno stanje životinje i da li je vakcinisana. Krupna stoka mora biti obeležena ušnom markicom i upisana u registar, a uz konje i goveda idu pasoš i veterinarsko uverenje, pa ih tražite na uvid. Životinju pogledajte uživo pre kapare i dogovorite prevoz odgovarajućim vozilom. Prodavci neka navedu broj grla, rasu i cenu po komadu ili po kilogramu žive mere.', text_en = 'Farm animals for sale from breeders and households all over Serbia: [piglets and pigs](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/svinje-i-prasici) for fattening and breeding, [cows, heifers and calves](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/krave-i-telad), [sheep and goats](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/ovce-i-koze), including Romanov and other breeds, [horses](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/konji) for work, riding and sport, and [poultry](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/zivina): chicks, laying hens, turkeys, ducks and geese. You choose the type of animal in the filter, and the place filter shows offers nearby, which matters for transport.

Before buying, ask about the age, breed and weight, the feeding and the animal''s health and whether it is vaccinated. Cattle must carry an ear tag and be entered in the register, and horses and cattle come with a passport and a veterinary certificate, so ask to see them. See the animal in person before paying a deposit and arrange transport in a suitable vehicle. Sellers should state the number of head, the breed and the price per animal or per kilogram of live weight.' WHERE slug = 'livestock' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Domaće životinje: [ovce i koze](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/ovce-i-koze), [konji](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/konji), [svinje i prasići](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/svinje-i-prasici), [krave i telad](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/krave-i-telad) i [živina](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/zivina), od uzgajivača i domaćinstava.

Pitajte za starost, rasu i zdravstveno stanje životinje i za veterinarske i pasoške dokumente. Dogovorite pregled i prevoz.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Livestock: [sheep and goats](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/ovce-i-koze), [horses](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/konji), [pigs and piglets](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/svinje-i-prasici), [cows and calves](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/krave-i-telad) and [poultry](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/zivina), from breeders and farms.

Ask about the animal''s age, breed and health, and for veterinary and passport documents. Arrange a viewing and transport.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema i hrana za ljubimce: [granule i konzerve za pse i mačke](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana), posip i pesak za mačke, [akvarijumi za ribice](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/akvarijumi) sa filterima, pumpama i grejačima, kao i terarijumi. Tu su i [kavezi, transporteri i kućice](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri) za pse, mačke, ptice i hrčke, ograde za pse, grebalice i kućice za mačke, [kreveti, ogrlice i povoci](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/lezaljke-i-povoci), odeća za pse i igračke. Vrstu opreme birate u filteru, a mnogo toga se prodaje gotovo novo, kada ljubimac preraste opremu ili je ne prihvati.

Kod hrane proverite rok trajanja i da li je pakovanje zatvoreno, a pre prelaska na dijetalnu hranu posavetujte se sa veterinarom. Akvarijum pre kupovine napunite vodom ili tražite da vidite da ne curi i pitajte za zapreminu i šta ide u kompletu. Kod transportera proverite bravu i ventilaciju i da li odgovara pravilima avio-kompanije ako putujete. Ako tražite novog člana porodice, pogledajte oglase za [pse](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi).', text_en = 'Pet supplies and food: [dry and wet food for dogs and cats](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana), cat litter, [fish tanks](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/akvarijumi) with filters, pumps and heaters, plus terrariums. There are also [cages, carriers and kennels](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri) for dogs, cats, birds and hamsters, dog pens, scratching posts and cat houses, [beds, collars and leads](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/lezaljke-i-povoci), dog clothes and toys. You choose the type of supplies in the filter, and a lot is sold almost new, when a pet outgrows it or will not use it.

With food, check the best-before date and that the bag is sealed, and talk to a vet before switching to a special diet. Fill a fish tank with water before buying or ask to see that it does not leak, and ask about its volume and what is included. With a carrier, check the latch and ventilation and whether it meets the airline''s rules if you travel. If you are looking for a new member of the family, see the ads for [dogs](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi).' WHERE slug = 'pet-supplies' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Oprema i hrana za ljubimce: [hrana za pse i mačke](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana), [akvarijumi i oprema](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/akvarijumi), [kavezi, transporteri i kućice](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri), [ležaljke, ogrlice i povoci](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/lezaljke-i-povoci).

Kod hrane proverite rok trajanja i da li je pakovanje zatvoreno, a kod akvarijuma zapreminu i da li curi.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Pet supplies and food: [dog and cat food](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana), [aquariums and equipment](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/akvarijumi), [cages, carriers and kennels](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri), [beds, collars and leads](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/lezaljke-i-povoci).

With food, check the expiry date and that the bag is sealed; with aquariums, the volume and that it does not leak.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Igračke za decu svih uzrasta, nove i polovne: [LEGO kocke](/oglasi/deca/igracke/lego) i kompleti Duplo, City, Friends, Ninjago, Technic, Star Wars i Minecraft, lutke i plišane igračke, autići na daljinsko upravljanje i automobili na akumulator, društvene igre i slagalice i montesori igračke od drveta. Za dvorište tu su [ljuljaške, tobogani i kućice za decu](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani), peskare i trambuline. Vrstu igračke birate u filteru, a polovne igračke su dobar izbor, jer ih deca brzo prerastu.

Kod LEGO kompleta i slagalica proverite da li su delovi kompletni i da li postoji uputstvo, a ako kupujete za kolekciju, pitajte i za originalnu kutiju. Igračka treba da odgovara uzrastu deteta: sitni delovi nisu za decu mlađu od tri godine. Kod igračaka i autića na baterije pitajte da li rade i da li ide punjač, a ljuljaške i tobogane pregledajte zbog pukotina i rđe. Za veću decu pogledajte i [dečije bicikle i trotinete](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli).', text_en = 'Toys for children of every age, new and used: [LEGO bricks](/oglasi/deca/igracke/lego) and Duplo, City, Friends, Ninjago, Technic, Star Wars and Minecraft sets, dolls and soft toys, remote control cars and battery ride-on cars, board games and puzzles, and wooden Montessori toys. For the garden there are [swings, slides and playhouses](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani), sandpits and trampolines. You choose the type of toy in the filter, and used toys are a good choice, as children outgrow them quickly.

With LEGO sets and puzzles, check that all the pieces are there and that the instructions are included, and if you are buying for a collection, ask about the original box. A toy should suit the child''s age: small parts are not for children under three. With battery toys and ride-on cars, ask whether they work and whether the charger is included, and check swings and slides for cracks and rust. For older children, see [kids'' bikes and scooters](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli) too.' WHERE slug = 'toys' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Igračke za decu svih uzrasta: [LEGO kocke](/oglasi/deca/igracke/lego), lutke i plišane igračke, autići i automobili na akumulator, društvene igre i [ljuljaške i tobogani za dvorište](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani).

Proverite da li su delovi kompletni, posebno kod LEGO kompleta i slagalica, i da li igračka odgovara uzrastu deteta. Kod igračaka na baterije pitajte da li rade.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Toys for children of all ages: [LEGO](/oglasi/deca/igracke/lego), dolls and soft toys, toy cars and battery-powered ride-ons, board games, and [swings and slides for the garden](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani).

Check that all parts are there, especially with LEGO sets and puzzles, and that the toy suits the child''s age. For battery toys, ask whether they work.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Nameštaj za bebe i decu: krevetci za bebe i krevetac 3 u 1 koji raste sa detetom, kolevke i prenosivi krevetci za putovanja, dečiji kreveti, kreveti na sprat i kompletne dečije sobe za dečake i devojčice. Tu su i komode za presvlačenje, ormari, radni stolovi, police i stolice za dečiju sobu, kao i posteljina za krevetac, ogradice, pletenice i baldahini. Vrstu nameštaja birate u filteru, a polovan dečiji nameštaj često je gotovo nov, jer se koristi samo nekoliko godina.

Kod krevetca proverite stabilnost, razmak između prečki i da li se dno spušta kako dete raste, a kod kreveta na sprat čvrstinu ograde i merdevina. Dušek mora tačno da legne u krevetac, bez razmaka uz ivice, pa pitajte za dimenzije, najčešće 120x60 ili 140x70. Pitajte da li se nameštaj rastavlja za prevoz i da li ima sve šrafove. Dušeke i veće krevete naći ćete u rubrici [kreveti i dušeci](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci), hranilice i ostalo za najmlađe u rubrici [oprema za bebe](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe), a sve za igru među oglasima za [igračke](/oglasi/deca/igracke).', text_en = 'Furniture for babies and children: baby cots and 3-in-1 cots that grow with the child, cradles and travel cots, children''s beds, bunk beds and complete kids'' rooms for boys and girls. There are also changing dressers, wardrobes, desks, shelves and chairs for the kids'' room, plus cot bedding, bumpers, braided bumpers and canopies. You choose the type of furniture in the filter, and used children''s furniture is often almost new, as it is used for only a few years.

With a cot, check its stability, the gap between the bars and whether the base lowers as the child grows; with bunk beds, how solid the rail and ladder are. The mattress must fit the cot exactly, with no gaps at the edges, so ask about the size, most often 120x60 or 140x70. Ask whether the furniture comes apart for transport and whether all the screws are there. Mattresses and bigger beds are in the [beds and mattresses](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci) section, high chairs and other things for the youngest under [baby gear](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe), and everything for play among the ads for [toys](/oglasi/deca/igracke).' WHERE slug = 'kids-furniture' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Krevetci za bebe i dečiji kreveti, kreveti na sprat, radni stolovi, ormari i komode za dečiju sobu.

Proverite stabilnost i stanje mehanizma, dimenzije dušeka i da li se nameštaj rastavlja za prevoz. Dušeke i veće krevete naći ćete u rubrici [kreveti i dušeci](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci), a sve za najmlađe u rubrici [oprema za bebe](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Cots and kids'' beds, bunk beds, desks, wardrobes and dressers for the children''s room.

Check stability and the mechanism, the mattress size and whether the furniture comes apart for transport. Mattresses and bigger beds are under [beds and mattresses](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci), and everything for the youngest under [baby gear](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Bicikli za odrasle i decu, novi i polovni: [električni bicikli](/oglasi/sport/bicikli/elektricni-bicikli), odnosno bicikli na struju za grad i za teren, MTB i brdski bicikli, gradski i trekking bicikli, drumski bicikli, kao i ženski i muški bicikli sa korpom za svakodnevnu vožnju. Najviše oglasa ima za Capriolo, Polar, Cube, Scott i Trek, a dosta je i polovnih bicikala iz uvoza. Uz bicikle se prodaju delovi i oprema: točkovi, menjači, kočnice, sedišta, korpe, svetla i nosači. Vrstu bicikla birate u filteru.

Veličinu rama birajte prema visini vozača i probajte bicikl pre kupovine. Proverite kočnice, menjač i lanac, da li točkovi idu pravo i da li ram ima pukotine ili tragove varenja. Kod električnog bicikla najvažnija je baterija: pitajte koliko kilometara prelazi na jedno punjenje, koliko je stara i da li ide punjač. Prodavci neka navedu model, veličinu točkova i rama i broj brzina. [Dečiji bicikli](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli) su u posebnoj rubrici, a za vožnju po gradu pogledajte i [električne trotinete](/oglasi/sport/elektricni-trotineti).', text_en = 'Bikes for adults and children, new and used: [electric bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli/elektricni-bicikli) for town and trail, MTB and mountain bikes, city and trekking bikes, road bikes, and women''s and men''s bikes with a basket for everyday riding. Most ads are for Capriolo, Polar, Cube, Scott and Trek, and there are plenty of imported used bikes too. Parts and accessories are sold alongside: wheels, derailleurs, brakes, saddles, baskets, lights and racks. You choose the type of bike in the filter.

Choose the frame size by the rider''s height and try the bike before buying. Check the brakes, gears and chain, whether the wheels run true and whether the frame has cracks or signs of welding. With an e-bike the battery matters most: ask how many kilometres it does on one charge, how old it is and whether the charger is included. Sellers should state the model, wheel and frame size and number of gears. [Kids'' bikes](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli) have their own section, and for getting around town see [electric scooters](/oglasi/sport/elektricni-trotineti) too.' WHERE slug = 'bikes' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Bicikli: [električni bicikli](/oglasi/sport/bicikli/elektricni-bicikli), MTB i brdski, gradski, trekking i [dečiji bicikli](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli), kao i delovi i oprema za bicikl.

Proverite veličinu rama u odnosu na visinu, stanje kočnica, menjača i lanca, a kod električnih bicikala bateriju. Prodavci neka navedu model i veličinu točkova. Za vožnju po gradu pogledajte i [električne trotinete](/oglasi/sport/elektricni-trotineti).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Bikes: [e-bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli/elektricni-bicikli), mountain bikes, city, trekking and [kids'' bikes](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli), plus bike parts and accessories.

Check the frame size against your height, the brakes, gears and chain, and the battery on e-bikes. Sellers should state the model and wheel size. For getting around town, see [e-scooters](/oglasi/sport/elektricni-trotineti) as well.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ženska odeća, nova i polovna, za svaku priliku: [haljine](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine) letnje, duge, bele i elegantne, [zimske i prolećne jakne i kaputi](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), [trenerke i kompleti](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/trenerke) Adidas, Nike i drugih marki, [farmerke, pantalone i helanke](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke), bluze, košulje i džemperi, suknje, kupaći kostimi i veš. Ima i odeće za punije dame, kao i komada poznatih brendova koji se prodaju po delu cene iz prodavnice. Vrstu odeće birate u filteru.

Prodavci neka navedu veličinu i mere, dužinu, obim struka i grudi, jer se iste oznake veličine razlikuju od brenda do brenda. Napišite materijal i stanje i da li je komad nošen, a fotografišite ga na osobi ili na ravnoj površini, pri dnevnom svetlu. Kupci neka pitaju za fleke i oštećenja i da li se odeća prala po uputstvu. Uz odeću pogledajte i [žensku obuću](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca).', text_en = 'Women''s clothing, new and used, for every occasion: [dresses](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine) for summer, long, white and elegant ones, [winter and spring jackets and coats](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), [tracksuits and sets](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/trenerke) from Adidas, Nike and other brands, [jeans, trousers and leggings](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke), blouses, shirts and jumpers, skirts, swimsuits and lingerie. There is plus-size clothing too, and pieces from well-known brands sold for a fraction of the shop price. You choose the type of clothing in the filter.

Sellers should state the size and measurements, the length, waist and bust, as the same size labels differ from brand to brand. Write the material and condition and whether the piece has been worn, and photograph it on a person or laid flat, in daylight. Buyers should ask about stains and damage and whether the clothes were washed as the label says. Along with clothes, see [women''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) too.' WHERE slug = 'womens-clothing' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Ženska odeća: [haljine](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine), [jakne i kaputi](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), [trenerke i kompleti](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/trenerke), [farmerke, pantalone i helanke](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke), [bluze i džemperi](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/bluze-i-kosulje). Polovni komadi poznatih brendova često se prodaju po delu cene.

Navedite veličinu i mere (dužinu, obim struka i grudi), materijal i stanje. Kupcima savetujemo da traže fotografiju na osobi ili na ravnoj površini.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Women''s clothing: [dresses](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine), [jackets and coats](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), [tracksuits and sets](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/trenerke), [jeans, trousers and leggings](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/pantalone-i-farmerke), [blouses and jumpers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/bluze-i-kosulje). Used pieces from well-known brands often sell for a fraction of the price.

State the size and measurements (length, waist and bust), material and condition. Buyers should ask for a photo of the item worn or laid flat.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Muška odeća, nova i polovna: [zimske, prolećne i kožne jakne, kaputi i mantili](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), perjane jakne i prsluci, [trenerke](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke) Adidas, Nike i Puma, kompleti i donji delovi, kao i [muška odela i sakoi](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi) za posao, svadbe i proslave. Tu su i farmerke i pantalone, košulje, majice, duksevi i džemperi. Vrstu odeće birate u filteru, a polovni komadi poznatih brendova često se prodaju po ceni mnogo nižoj od nove.

Prodavci neka navedu veličinu i mere: širinu ramena, dužinu rukava i dužinu odevnog predmeta, a kod pantalona obim struka i dužinu nogavice. Kod odela napišite broj sakoa i pantalona i da li je odelo prepravljano, a kod kožnih jakni stanje kože i postave. Fotografišite odeću pri dnevnom svetlu, spreda i otpozadi. Uz odelo pogledajte [mušku obuću](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca), a za venčanje i [venčanice i svečanu odeću](/oglasi/moda/vencanice).', text_en = 'Men''s clothing, new and used: [winter, spring and leather jackets, coats and trench coats](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), down jackets and gilets, [tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke) from Adidas, Nike and Puma, sets and bottoms, plus [men''s suits and blazers](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi) for work, weddings and celebrations. There are also jeans and trousers, shirts, T-shirts, hoodies and jumpers. You choose the type of clothing in the filter, and used pieces from well-known brands often sell for much less than new.

Sellers should state the size and measurements: shoulder width, sleeve length and the length of the garment, and for trousers the waist and inside leg. For a suit, write the jacket and trouser sizes and whether it has been altered; for leather jackets, the state of the leather and lining. Photograph clothes in daylight, front and back. With a suit, see [men''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca), and for a wedding [wedding dresses and formal wear](/oglasi/moda/vencanice) too.' WHERE slug = 'mens-clothing' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Muška odeća: [jakne i kaputi](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), [trenerke](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke), [odela i sakoi](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi), farmerke i pantalone, košulje, majice i duksevi.

Navedite veličinu i mere (ramena, rukav, dužina), materijal i stanje. Kod odela proverite i broj pantalona.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Men''s clothing: [jackets and coats](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/jakne-i-kaputi), [tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/trenerke), [suits and blazers](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi), jeans and trousers, shirts, T-shirts and hoodies.

State the size and measurements (shoulders, sleeve, length), material and condition. For suits, check the trouser size too.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ženska obuća, nova i polovna: [patike](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike) Nike, Adidas, Puma, New Balance, Skechers i Converse, bele patike za svaki dan, [čizme i gležnjače](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cizme), čizme na štiklu i gumene čizme, [cipele i štikle](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), baletanke i mokasine, kao i [sandale, sandalete, espadrile i papuče](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce) za leto. Ima mnogo polovnih pari u dobrom stanju i novih koji nisu odgovarali po broju. Vrstu obuće birate u filteru.

Pre kupovine pitajte za broj i dužinu gazišta u centimetrima, jer se veličine razlikuju od brenda do brenda, a isti broj drugačije odgovara kod patika i kod cipela na štiklu. Fotografije đona, pete i unutrašnjosti pokazuju stvarno stanje obuće. Kod skupljih patika tražite fotografiju etikete sa unutrašnje strane jezika i kutije, da proverite da li su originalne. Uz obuću pogledajte i [torbe i novčanike](/oglasi/moda/torbe).', text_en = 'Women''s shoes, new and used: [trainers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike) from Nike, Adidas, Puma, New Balance, Skechers and Converse, white trainers for every day, [boots and ankle boots](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cizme), high-heeled boots and wellies, [shoes and heels](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), ballet flats and loafers, plus [sandals, heeled sandals, espadrilles and slippers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce) for summer. There are many used pairs in good condition and new ones that did not fit. You choose the type of footwear in the filter.

Before buying, ask about the size and the insole length in centimetres, as sizes differ from brand to brand, and the same size fits differently in trainers and in heels. Photos of the sole, heel and inside show the real condition of the shoes. With pricier trainers, ask for a photo of the label inside the tongue and of the box, to check that they are genuine. Along with shoes, see [bags and wallets](/oglasi/moda/torbe) too.' WHERE slug = 'womens-shoes' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Ženska obuća: [patike](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike), [čizme i gležnjače](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cizme), [cipele i štikle](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), baletanke, [sandale i papuče](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce). Ima mnogo polovnih pari u dobrom stanju, kao i novih koji nisu odgovarali po broju.

Proverite broj i dužinu gazišta u centimetrima, jer se veličine razlikuju po brendu. Fotografije đona i unutrašnjosti pokazuju stvarno stanje obuće.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Women''s shoes: [trainers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/patike), [boots and ankle boots](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cizme), [heels](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), ballet flats, [sandals and slippers](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce). There are many used pairs in good condition and new ones that did not fit.

Check the size and the insole length in centimetres, as sizes differ by brand. Photos of the sole and the inside show the real condition.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Muška obuća, nova i polovna: [patike](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike) Nike, Adidas, Puma, New Balance, Asics i Lacoste, kožne, zimske i duboke patike, [cipele](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele) za odelo i elegantne kožne cipele, duboke cipele i čizme za zimu, kao i [papuče, sandale i klompe](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce). Vrstu obuće birate u filteru, a nove patike koje nisu odgovarale po broju i jedva nošeni parovi prodaju se znatno ispod cene iz prodavnice.

Pitajte za broj i dužinu gazišta u centimetrima i uporedite je sa obućom koju već nosite. Pogledajte đon i petu, jer se po njima najbolje vidi koliko je obuća nošena, i proverite da li su šavovi i lepak čitavi. Kod brendiranih patika tražite fotografiju etikete i kutije, a kod kožnih cipela pitajte kako su održavane. Za trčanje i trening pogledajte [sportsku obuću](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca), a uz cipele za odelo i [muška odela](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi).', text_en = 'Men''s shoes, new and used: [trainers](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike) from Nike, Adidas, Puma, New Balance, Asics and Lacoste, leather, winter and high-top trainers, [shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele) to wear with a suit and smart leather shoes, ankle shoes and winter boots, plus [slippers, sandals and clogs](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce). You choose the type of footwear in the filter, and new trainers that did not fit and barely worn pairs sell well below the shop price.

Ask about the size and the insole length in centimetres and compare it with shoes you already wear. Look at the sole and heel, which show best how much the shoes have been worn, and check that the stitching and glue are intact. With branded trainers, ask for a photo of the label and the box; with leather shoes, ask how they were looked after. For running and training, see [sports shoes](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca), and with smart shoes [men''s suits](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi) too.' WHERE slug = 'mens-shoes' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Muška obuća: [patike](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike), [cipele](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele), čizme i duboke cipele, [papuče i sandale](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce), nove i polovne.

Proverite broj i dužinu gazišta i stanje đona. Kod brendiranih patika tražite fotografije etikete unutar jezika.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Men''s shoes: [trainers](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/patike), [shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/cipele), boots, [slippers and sandals](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca/sandale-i-papuce), new and used.

Check the size, insole length and the condition of the sole. For branded trainers, ask for photos of the label inside the tongue.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ručni satovi za muškarce i žene, novi i polovni: [muški satovi](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi) i [ženski satovi](/oglasi/moda/satovi/zenski-satovi) Casio, Seiko, Tissot, Citizen, Festina, Fossil, Guess i Swatch, digitalni satovi i Casio G-Shock, kao i luksuzni satovi Rolex, Omega i Longines za kolekcionare. Tu su i mehanički i automatski satovi, stari i kolekcionarski komadi, a [pametni satovi](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi) imaju svoju rubriku. Vrstu sata birate u filteru.

Kod skupljih satova tražite garantni list, originalnu kutiju i račun i uporedite serijski broj sa onim u papirima, a sat pre kupovine po mogućnosti pokažite časovničaru. Proverite da li sat radi tačno, da li krunica i dugmad rade i u kakvom su stanju staklo i narukvica. Kod mehaničkih satova pitajte kada su poslednji put servisirani. Prodavci neka navedu model, prečnik kućišta i materijal narukvice. Uz sat se često kupuje i [nakit](/oglasi/moda/nakit).', text_en = 'Wristwatches for men and women, new and used: [men''s watches](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi) and [women''s watches](/oglasi/moda/satovi/zenski-satovi) from Casio, Seiko, Tissot, Citizen, Festina, Fossil, Guess and Swatch, digital watches and the Casio G-Shock, plus luxury Rolex, Omega and Longines watches for collectors. There are also mechanical and automatic watches, old and collectible pieces, and [smartwatches](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi) have their own section. You choose the type of watch in the filter.

With pricier watches, ask for the warranty card, the original box and the receipt and compare the serial number with the one in the papers, and if you can, show the watch to a watchmaker before buying. Check that it keeps time, that the crown and buttons work, and the state of the glass and strap. With mechanical watches, ask when they were last serviced. Sellers should state the model, case diameter and strap material. A watch is often bought together with [jewellery](/oglasi/moda/nakit).' WHERE slug = 'watches' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Satovi za muškarce](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi) i [žene](/oglasi/moda/satovi/zenski-satovi): ručni satovi Casio, Tissot, Seiko, Guess, Swatch i drugi, mehanički, kvarcni i [pametni](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi). Tu su i stari i kolekcionarski satovi.

Kod skupljih satova tražite garantni list, kutiju i račun i proverite da li sat radi tačno. Prodavci neka navedu model, prečnik kućišta i stanje stakla i narukvice.' AND BINARY text_en = '[Watches for men](/oglasi/moda/satovi/muski-satovi) and [women](/oglasi/moda/satovi/zenski-satovi): Casio, Tissot, Seiko, Guess, Swatch and others, mechanical, quartz and [smart](/oglasi/elektronika/pametni-satovi). Vintage and collectible watches are here too.

For expensive watches, ask for the warranty card, box and receipt and check that the watch keeps time. Sellers should state the model, case diameter and the condition of the glass and strap.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Torbe, tašne i novčanici, novi i polovni: [ženske torbe](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe) i torbice, kožne torbe, tašne za izlazak i torbe za laptop, [muške torbe](/oglasi/moda/torbe/muske-torbe) i torbice preko ramena, [novčanici](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici) za muškarce i žene, novčanici za kartice, kaiševi, rančevi i koferi za putovanja. Ima mnogo torbi poznatih brendova, kao što je Guess, koje se prodaju po delu prvobitne cene, ali i torbi od kože i ručnog rada. Vrstu birate u filteru.

Kod brendiranih torbi tražite fotografije unutrašnjosti, etikete, serijskog broja i kopče i, ako postoji, račun, jer se poznati modeli često kopiraju. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije i materijal i fotografišu ručke, uglove i dno, gde se habanje prvo vidi. Kod kofera proverite točkiće, ručku i patent zatvarače. Uz torbu pogledajte i [žensku obuću](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) i [satove](/oglasi/moda/satovi).', text_en = 'Bags, handbags and wallets, new and used: [women''s bags](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe) and small bags, leather bags, evening bags and laptop bags, [men''s bags](/oglasi/moda/torbe/muske-torbe) and shoulder bags, [wallets](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici) for men and women, card holders, belts, backpacks and suitcases for travelling. There are many bags from well-known brands such as Guess sold for a fraction of the original price, as well as leather and handmade bags. You choose the type in the filter.

With branded bags, ask for photos of the inside, the label, the serial number and the clasp and, if there is one, the receipt, as well-known models are often copied. Sellers should state the size and material and photograph the handles, corners and bottom, where wear shows first. With suitcases, check the wheels, handle and zips. Along with a bag, see [women''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) and [watches](/oglasi/moda/satovi) too.' WHERE slug = 'bags' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Torbe, tašne, [novčanici](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici) i kaiševi: [ženske torbe](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe), [muške torbe](/oglasi/moda/torbe/muske-torbe), rančevi i koferi, poznati brendovi i ručni rad.

Kod brendiranih torbi tražite fotografije unutrašnjosti, etikete i serijskog broja i, ako postoji, račun. Navedite dimenzije i stanje ručki i uglova.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Bags, handbags, [wallets](/oglasi/moda/torbe/novcanici) and belts: [women''s](/oglasi/moda/torbe/zenske-torbe) and [men''s bags](/oglasi/moda/torbe/muske-torbe), backpacks and suitcases, well-known brands and handmade pieces.

For branded bags, ask for photos of the inside, the labels and the serial number and, if available, the receipt. State the dimensions and the condition of the handles and corners.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Venčanice i svečane haljine, nove i nošene jednom: venčanice svih krojeva, svečane i elegantne haljine za svadbu, duge i do kolena, maturske haljine i haljine za malu maturu, svečane haljine za mame, za punije dame i za trudnice, kao i haljine za krštenje i druge proslave. Za mladoženje i goste tu su odela za venčanje i svečani kompleti. Vrstu birate u filteru, a mnoge haljine se prodaju posle jednog nošenja, po ceni mnogo nižoj od nove ili od iznajmljivanja u salonu.

Prodavci neka navedu veličinu i mere, obim grudi, struka i kukova i dužinu haljine, i napišu da li je haljina prepravljana i da li može još da se suzi ili proširi. Kupcima savetujemo da haljinu probaju pre kupovine i da pogledaju šavove, čipku i perle, a kod venčanice i donji deo, koji se najviše haba. Uz haljinu pogledajte i [nakit](/oglasi/moda/nakit) i [cipele i štikle](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), a mladoženje [muška odela](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi). Za druge prilike tu su i obične [haljine](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine).', text_en = 'Wedding dresses and formal dresses, new and worn once: wedding dresses in every cut, formal and elegant dresses for weddings, long and knee-length, prom and graduation dresses, formal dresses for mothers of the bride, plus-size and maternity, and dresses for christenings and other celebrations. For grooms and guests there are wedding suits and formal sets. You choose the type in the filter, and many dresses are sold after being worn once, for much less than new or than hiring one from a salon.

Sellers should state the size and measurements, bust, waist, hips and the length of the dress, and write whether it has been altered and whether it can still be taken in or let out. Buyers are advised to try the dress on before buying and look at the seams, lace and beads, and with a wedding dress the hem, which wears most. With a dress, see [jewellery](/oglasi/moda/nakit) and [shoes and heels](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca/cipele), and grooms [men''s suits](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi). For other occasions there are everyday [dresses](/oglasi/moda/zenska-odeca/haljine) too.' WHERE slug = 'wedding' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Venčanice, svečane i maturske haljine i odela za venčanje, nove i nošene jednom.

Navedite veličinu i mere, i da li je haljina prepravljana. Kupcima savetujemo da haljinu probaju pre kupovine. Uz venčanicu pogledajte i [nakit](/oglasi/moda/nakit) i [žensku obuću](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca), a mladoženje [muška odela](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Wedding gowns, evening and prom dresses and wedding suits, new and worn once.

State the size and measurements and whether the dress has been altered. Buyers should try the dress on before buying. To go with the gown, see [jewellery](/oglasi/moda/nakit) and [women''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca); grooms can browse [men''s suits](/oglasi/moda/muska-odeca/odela-i-sakoi).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Parfemi, originalni i u povoljnim pakovanjima: [ženski parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/zenski-parfemi) i [muški parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/muski-parfemi) poznatih kuća kao što su Dior, Versace, Valentino, Prada i YSL, [arapski parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/arapski-parfemi) Lattafa i Armaf, kao i testeri, dekanti i mini pakovanja za probu. Mnogi prodaju parfeme koje su dobili na poklon, a nisu im se dopali, ili bočice koje su samo probali, pa se do originalnog parfema može doći po nižoj ceni. Vrstu parfema birate u filteru.

Kod kupovine tražite fotografije bočice, kutije i serijskog broja, koji treba da se poklapa na bočici i na pakovanju, i pitajte koliko je parfema ostalo i gde je kupljen. Original ima kvalitetnu bočicu i čep, uredno odštampano pakovanje i miris koji se tokom dana menja, ali ne nestaje posle sat vremena. Previše niska cena za nov parfem poznate marke razlog je za oprez. Uz parfem pogledajte i [kozmetiku i negu](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika).', text_en = 'Perfumes, genuine and in good-value sizes: [women''s perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/zenski-parfemi) and [men''s fragrances](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/muski-parfemi) from well-known houses such as Dior, Versace, Valentino, Prada and YSL, [Arabic perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/arapski-parfemi) from Lattafa and Armaf, plus testers, decants and travel sizes to try. Many people sell perfumes they got as a gift and did not like, or bottles they only tried, so you can get a genuine fragrance for less. You choose the type of perfume in the filter.

When buying, ask for photos of the bottle, the box and the batch code, which should match on the bottle and the packaging, and ask how much is left and where it was bought. A genuine perfume has a quality bottle and cap, neatly printed packaging and a scent that changes during the day but does not vanish after an hour. A price that is too low for a new perfume of a famous brand is a reason for caution. With a perfume, see [cosmetics and care](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika) too.' WHERE slug = 'perfumes' AND BINARY text_sr = '[Parfemi za žene](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/zenski-parfemi) i [muškarce](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/muski-parfemi), [arapski parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/arapski-parfemi), testeri i dekanti po povoljnim cenama. Mnogi prodaju parfeme koje su dobili na poklon ili samo probali.

Kod kupovine tražite fotografiju bočice i pakovanja sa serijskim brojem i pitajte koliko je parfema ostalo. Originalni parfemi imaju kvalitetno pakovanje i ujednačen miris; previše niska cena je razlog za oprez.' AND BINARY text_en = '[Perfumes for women](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/zenski-parfemi) and [men](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/muski-parfemi), [Arabic perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi/arapski-parfemi), testers and decants at good prices. Many sellers offer perfumes they got as a gift or only tried.

When buying, ask for a photo of the bottle and box with the batch code and ask how much is left. Genuine perfumes have quality packaging and a consistent scent; a price that is too low is a reason for caution.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovni kamioni, kombiji, autobusi i druga radna vozila za prevoz robe i putnika: od malih dostavnih kombija do kipera i tegljača. Filter po vrsti vozila brzo sužava ponudu na kamione, kombije ili autobuse, a posebno možete izdvojiti vozila koja se prodaju na rate ili lizing. Priključna vozila su u kategoriji [prikolice](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice).

Kod teretnih vozila kilometraža govori manje od načina održavanja: tražite servisnu dokumentaciju, proverite kvačilo, šasiju i tovarni prostor i uporedite nosivost i broj sedišta sa onim što piše u saobraćajnoj dozvoli. Delove za popravku naći ćete među oglasima za [auto delove](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), a ako vam vozilo treba samo za jednu turu, tu su [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Used trucks, vans, buses and other work vehicles for carrying goods and passengers: from small delivery vans to tippers and tractor units. The vehicle type filter quickly narrows the offer to trucks, vans or buses, and you can single out vehicles sold on instalments or leasing. Towed vehicles are in [trailers](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice).

With commercial vehicles the mileage says less than the way they were maintained: ask for service records, check the clutch, the chassis and the load area, and compare the payload and number of seats with the registration certificate. Spare parts are among the ads for [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), and if you need a vehicle for a single trip, there is [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE slug = 'trucks-vans' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Polovni kamioni, kombiji, autobusi i druga radna vozila za prevoz robe i putnika: od malih dostavnih kombija do kipera i tegljača. Filter po vrsti vozila, gorivu, menjaču i godištu brzo sužava ponudu, a posebno možete izdvojiti vozila koja se prodaju na rate ili lizing. Priključna vozila su u kategoriji [prikolice](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice).

Kod teretnih vozila kilometraža govori manje od načina održavanja: tražite servisnu dokumentaciju, proverite kvačilo, šasiju i tovarni prostor i uporedite nosivost i broj sedišta sa onim što piše u saobraćajnoj dozvoli. Delove za popravku naći ćete među oglasima za [auto delove](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), a ako vam vozilo treba samo za jednu turu, tu su [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Used trucks, vans, buses and other work vehicles for carrying goods and passengers: from small delivery vans to tippers and tractor units. Filters by vehicle type, fuel, gearbox and year narrow the offer quickly, and you can single out vehicles sold on instalments or leasing. Towed vehicles are in [trailers](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice).

With commercial vehicles the mileage says less than the way they were maintained: ask for service records, check the clutch, the chassis and the load area, and compare the payload and number of seats with the registration certificate. Spare parts are among the ads for [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), and if you need a vehicle for a single trip, there is [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovni i novi laptopovi svih klasa: poslovni Lenovo, Dell i HP modeli, gejming laptopovi sa jačom grafikom, lagani ultrabukovi i [MacBook laptopovi](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi/apple). Filter po marki brzo izdvaja Lenovo, Dell, HP, Asus, Acer ili Apple modele.

Pri pregledu proverite ekran na svetloj i tamnoj pozadini, tastaturu, zglobove, priključke i zdravlje baterije: pitajte koliko sati drži i koliko ciklusa ima. Uverite se da laptop nije zaključan lozinkom u BIOS-u ni vezan za tuđi nalog. Laptopovi iz firmi često su dobro očuvani, ali pitajte za godinu proizvodnje. Prodavci neka navedu procesor, RAM, disk, stanje baterije i da li ide originalni punjač. Ako vam prenosivost nije važna, više snage za isti novac daju [desktop računari](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari), a za čitanje i filmove dovoljan je [tablet](/oglasi/elektronika/tableti).', text_en = 'Used and new laptops of every class: business Lenovo, Dell and HP models, gaming laptops with stronger graphics, light ultrabooks and [MacBooks](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi/apple). The brand filter quickly picks out Lenovo, Dell, HP, Asus, Acer or Apple models.

When inspecting, check the screen on a light and a dark background, the keyboard, the hinges, the ports and the battery health: ask how many hours it lasts and how many cycles it has. Make sure the laptop is not locked with a BIOS password or tied to someone else''s account. Ex-company laptops are often well kept, but ask for the year of manufacture. Sellers should state the processor, RAM, drive, battery condition and whether the original charger is included. If portability does not matter, [desktop computers](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari) give more power for the same money, and for reading and films a [tablet](/oglasi/elektronika/tableti) is enough.' WHERE slug = 'laptops' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Polovni i novi laptopovi svih klasa: poslovni Lenovo, Dell i HP modeli, gejming laptopovi sa jačom grafikom, lagani ultrabukovi i [MacBook laptopovi](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi/apple). Filter po marki, memoriji i disku brzo izdvaja modele koji vam odgovaraju.

Pri pregledu proverite ekran na svetloj i tamnoj pozadini, tastaturu, zglobove, priključke i zdravlje baterije: pitajte koliko sati drži i koliko ciklusa ima. Uverite se da laptop nije zaključan lozinkom u BIOS-u ni vezan za tuđi nalog. Laptopovi iz firmi često su dobro očuvani, ali pitajte za godinu proizvodnje. Prodavci neka navedu procesor, RAM, disk, stanje baterije i da li ide originalni punjač. Ako vam prenosivost nije važna, više snage za isti novac daju [desktop računari](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari), a za čitanje i filmove dovoljan je [tablet](/oglasi/elektronika/tableti).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Used and new laptops of every class: business Lenovo, Dell and HP models, gaming laptops with stronger graphics, light ultrabooks and [MacBooks](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi/apple). The filter by brand, memory and drive quickly picks out the models that suit you.

When inspecting, check the screen on a light and a dark background, the keyboard, the hinges, the ports and the battery health: ask how many hours it lasts and how many cycles it has. Make sure the laptop is not locked with a BIOS password or tied to someone else''s account. Ex-company laptops are often well kept, but ask for the year of manufacture. Sellers should state the processor, RAM, drive, battery condition and whether the original charger is included. If portability does not matter, [desktop computers](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari) give more power for the same money, and for reading and films a [tablet](/oglasi/elektronika/tableti) is enough.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Moto oprema za vozače i suvozače: kacige, jakne, pantalone, rukavice i čizme sa protektorima, kao i delovi i dodaci za motocikle i skutere. U filteru birate kacige, odeću ili delove.

Kaciga je najvažniji deo opreme: proverite datum proizvodnje i homologaciju, a polovnu kupujte samo ako joj znate istoriju, jer kaciga koja je padala više ne štiti kako treba. Kod jakni i pantalona pogledajte da li su protektori na mestu, a veličinu obavezno probajte. Prodavci neka navedu marku, veličinu i koliko je sezona oprema nošena. Same motore naći ćete u kategoriji [motocikli i skuteri](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), a gume za njih u [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).', text_en = 'Motorcycle gear for riders and passengers: helmets, jackets, trousers, gloves and boots with protectors, plus parts and accessories for motorcycles and scooters. In the filter you pick helmets, clothing or parts.

The helmet is the most important piece: check the production date and the approval label, and buy a used one only if you know its history, because a helmet that has been dropped no longer protects properly. With jackets and trousers, see that the protectors are in place, and always try the size on. Sellers should state the brand, the size and how many seasons the gear was worn. The bikes themselves are in [motorcycles and scooters](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), and their tyres in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).' WHERE slug = 'motorcycle-gear' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Moto oprema za vozače i suvozače: kacige, jakne, pantalone, rukavice i čizme sa protektorima, kao i delovi i dodaci za motocikle i skutere. Veličinu i vrstu opreme birate u filteru, pa brzo stižete do onoga što vam odgovara.

Kaciga je najvažniji deo opreme: proverite datum proizvodnje i homologaciju, a polovnu kupujte samo ako joj znate istoriju, jer kaciga koja je padala više ne štiti kako treba. Kod jakni i pantalona pogledajte da li su protektori na mestu, a veličinu obavezno probajte. Prodavci neka navedu marku, veličinu i koliko je sezona oprema nošena. Same motore naći ćete u kategoriji [motocikli i skuteri](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), a gume za njih u [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Motorcycle gear for riders and passengers: helmets, jackets, trousers, gloves and boots with protectors, plus parts and accessories for motorcycles and scooters. You choose the size and the type of gear in the filter, so you quickly get to what suits you.

The helmet is the most important piece: check the production date and the approval label, and buy a used one only if you know its history, because a helmet that has been dropped no longer protects properly. With jackets and trousers, see that the protectors are in place, and always try the size on. Sellers should state the brand, the size and how many seasons the gear was worn. The bikes themselves are in [motorcycles and scooters](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), and their tyres in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sportska odeća i obuća za trening i takmičenje: patike za trčanje, košarku, fudbal i teretanu, kopačke, dresovi, šorcevi, helanke, trenerke i jakne poznatih marki.

Kod patika za trčanje pogledajte đon i petu: istrošen i nakrivljen đon više ne amortizuje, pa takve patike nisu za ozbiljniji trening. Tražite fotografiju etikete sa veličinom u centimetrima, jer se brojevi razlikuju među markama. Originalne patike imaju šifru modela na etiketi i kutiji i uredne šavove, bez tragova lepka. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model, dužinu gazišta i koliko su patike nošene. Modele za svaki dan naći ćete na stranici [patike](/oglasi/moda/patike), komplete među [trenerkama](/oglasi/moda/trenerke), a sprave za vežbanje u [fitnes opremi](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).', text_en = 'Sportswear and sports shoes for training and competition: running, basketball, football and gym shoes, football boots, jerseys, shorts, leggings, tracksuits and jackets from well-known brands.

With running shoes, look at the sole and the heel: a worn, lopsided sole no longer cushions, so such shoes are not for serious training. Ask for a photo of the label with the size in centimetres, because sizes differ between brands. Genuine shoes have the model code on the label and the box and neat stitching with no traces of glue. Sellers should state the brand, the model, the insole length and how much the shoes were worn. Everyday models are on the [trainers](/oglasi/moda/patike) page, sets among [tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/trenerke), and exercise machines in [fitness equipment](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).' WHERE slug = 'sports-shoes' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Sportska odeća i obuća za trening i takmičenje: patike za trčanje, košarku, fudbal i teretanu, kopačke, dresovi, šorcevi, helanke, trenerke i jakne poznatih marki. Veličinu i boju birate u filteru.

Kod patika za trčanje pogledajte đon i petu: istrošen i nakrivljen đon više ne amortizuje, pa takve patike nisu za ozbiljniji trening. Tražite fotografiju etikete sa veličinom u centimetrima, jer se brojevi razlikuju među markama. Originalne patike imaju šifru modela na etiketi i kutiji i uredne šavove, bez tragova lepka. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model, dužinu gazišta i koliko su patike nošene. Modele za svaki dan naći ćete na stranici [patike](/oglasi/moda/patike), komplete među [trenerkama](/oglasi/moda/trenerke), a sprave za vežbanje u [fitnes opremi](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Sportswear and sports shoes for training and competition: running, basketball, football and gym shoes, football boots, jerseys, shorts, leggings, tracksuits and jackets from well-known brands. You choose the size and colour in the filter.

With running shoes, look at the sole and the heel: a worn, lopsided sole no longer cushions, so such shoes are not for serious training. Ask for a photo of the label with the size in centimetres, because sizes differ between brands. Genuine shoes have the model code on the label and the box and neat stitching with no traces of glue. Sellers should state the brand, the model, the insole length and how much the shoes were worn. Everyday models are on the [trainers](/oglasi/moda/patike) page, sets among [tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/trenerke), and exercise machines in [fitness equipment](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Radna odeća, obuća i uniforme: radna odela, kombinezoni i pantalone, zaštitne cipele i čizme sa čeličnom kapom, prsluci, rukavice, šlemovi i naočare, kao i kuvarske, konobarske i medicinske uniforme.

Zaštitna obuća nosi oznaku klase: S1 je za suve prostore, a S3 ima i zaštitu od probijanja đona i vlage, pa je traže gradilišta. Proverite da kapa nije udarana i da đon nije odlepljen. Kod odeće gledajte šavove, rajsferšluse i reflektujuće trake, koje posle mnogo pranja gube sjaj. Firme često prodaju veće količine nove opreme sa lagera, pa pitajte za cenu za više komada. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu, klasu zaštite i da li je oprema nova. Alat potražite među [električnim alatima](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati), a posao u struci među oglasima za [građevinu i zanate](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati).', text_en = 'Workwear, safety footwear and uniforms: work suits, overalls and trousers, safety shoes and boots with a steel toe cap, vests, gloves, helmets and goggles, plus chef, waiter and medical uniforms.

Safety footwear carries a class mark: S1 is for dry areas, while S3 also has a puncture-resistant sole and protection from moisture, so building sites require it. Check that the toe cap has not taken a blow and that the sole is not coming off. With clothing, look at the seams, zips and reflective strips, which lose their shine after many washes. Companies often sell larger quantities of new stock, so ask about the price for several pieces. Sellers should state the size, the protection class and whether the gear is new. Look for tools among [power tools](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati), and for work in the trade among the ads for [construction and trades](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati).' WHERE slug = 'workwear' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Radna odeća, obuća i uniforme: radna odela, kombinezoni i pantalone, zaštitne cipele i čizme sa čeličnom kapom, prsluci, rukavice, šlemovi i naočare, kao i kuvarske, konobarske i medicinske uniforme. Veličinu birate u filteru.

Zaštitna obuća nosi oznaku klase: S1 je za suve prostore, a S3 ima i zaštitu od probijanja đona i vlage, pa je traže gradilišta. Proverite da kapa nije udarana i da đon nije odlepljen. Kod odeće gledajte šavove, rajsferšluse i reflektujuće trake, koje posle mnogo pranja gube sjaj. Firme često prodaju veće količine nove opreme sa lagera, pa pitajte za cenu za više komada. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu, klasu zaštite i da li je oprema nova. Alat potražite među [električnim alatima](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati), a posao u struci među oglasima za [građevinu i zanate](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Workwear, safety footwear and uniforms: work suits, overalls and trousers, safety shoes and boots with a steel toe cap, vests, gloves, helmets and goggles, plus chef, waiter and medical uniforms. You choose the size in the filter.

Safety footwear carries a class mark: S1 is for dry areas, while S3 also has a puncture-resistant sole and protection from moisture, so building sites require it. Check that the toe cap has not taken a blow and that the sole is not coming off. With clothing, look at the seams, zips and reflective strips, which lose their shine after many washes. Companies often sell larger quantities of new stock, so ask about the price for several pieces. Sellers should state the size, the protection class and whether the gear is new. Look for tools among [power tools](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati), and for work in the trade among the ads for [construction and trades](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Obuća za decu svih uzrasta: patike, sandale, čizme, gumene čizme, papuče, baletanke i prve cipelice za prohodavanje. Deca obuću prerastu za jednu sezonu, pa je polovna često jedva nošena.

Kupujte prema dužini unutrašnjeg gazišta u centimetrima, a ne prema broju: izmerite detetovo stopalo i dodajte oko jedan centimetar. Pogledajte đon i petu, jer obuća nakrivljenog đona nije dobra za stopalo koje se razvija. Uložak treba da bude čist i ceo, a čičak i rajsferšlusi ispravni. Prodavci neka navedu marku, broj, dužinu gazišta i sezonu. Garderobu u istoj veličini potražite u kategoriji [odeća za decu](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu), a modele za odrasle među [ženskom](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) i [muškom obućom](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca).', text_en = 'Children''s shoes for every age: trainers, sandals, boots, wellies, slippers, ballet flats and first walking shoes. Children outgrow shoes in a season, so used pairs are often barely worn.

Buy by the insole length in centimetres, not by the size number: measure the child''s foot and add about one centimetre. Look at the sole and the heel, because shoes with a lopsided sole are not good for a developing foot. The insole should be clean and intact, and the Velcro and zips working. Sellers should state the brand, the size, the insole length and the season. Clothes in the same size are in [children''s clothing](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu), and adult models among [women''s](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) and [men''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca).' WHERE slug = 'kids-shoes' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Obuća za decu svih uzrasta: patike, sandale, čizme, gumene čizme, papuče, baletanke i prve cipelice za prohodavanje. Deca obuću prerastu za jednu sezonu, pa je polovna često jedva nošena. Veličinu i boju birate u filteru.

Kupujte prema dužini unutrašnjeg gazišta u centimetrima, a ne prema broju: izmerite detetovo stopalo i dodajte oko jedan centimetar. Pogledajte đon i petu, jer obuća nakrivljenog đona nije dobra za stopalo koje se razvija. Uložak treba da bude čist i ceo, a čičak i rajsferšlusi ispravni. Prodavci neka navedu marku, broj, dužinu gazišta i sezonu. Garderobu u istoj veličini potražite u kategoriji [odeća za decu](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu), a modele za odrasle među [ženskom](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) i [muškom obućom](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Children''s shoes for every age: trainers, sandals, boots, wellies, slippers, ballet flats and first walking shoes. Children outgrow shoes in a season, so used pairs are often barely worn. You choose the size and colour in the filter.

Buy by the insole length in centimetres, not by the size number: measure the child''s foot and add about one centimetre. Look at the sole and the heel, because shoes with a lopsided sole are not good for a developing foot. The insole should be clean and intact, and the Velcro and zips working. Sellers should state the brand, the size, the insole length and the season. Clothes in the same size are in [children''s clothing](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu), and adult models among [women''s](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) and [men''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za zimske sportove: [skije i pancerice](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), snoubord daske i čizme, [ski odeća](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca), kacige, naočare i štapovi, kao i [sanke i klizaljke](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke). Vrstu opreme birate u filteru, a ponuda je najveća pred početak sezone.

Dužinu skija birajte prema visini, težini i znanju: početnicima odgovaraju kraće i mekše. Pogledajte ivice i klizne površine, a vezove obavezno dajte na podešavanje u servis. Pancerice se biraju po dužini stopala u centimetrima i moraju da stežu ravnomerno, bez žuljanja. Kacigu koja je pretrpela udarac ne treba kupovati. Prodavci neka navedu dužinu, radijus, model vezova i broj sezona. Smeštaj uz staze potražite na stranicama [Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik) i [Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor).', text_en = 'Winter sports equipment: [skis and ski boots](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), snowboards and boots, [ski clothing](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca), helmets, goggles and poles, plus [sledges and ice skates](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke). You choose the type of gear in the filter, and the offer is biggest just before the season starts.

Choose the ski length by your height, weight and skill: shorter and softer skis suit beginners. Look at the edges and the bases, and always have the bindings adjusted at a service shop. Ski boots are chosen by foot length in centimetres and must grip evenly, without pressure points. A helmet that has taken a blow should not be bought. Sellers should state the length, the radius, the binding model and the number of seasons. Look for accommodation by the slopes on the [Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik) and [Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) pages.' WHERE slug = 'winter-sports' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Oprema za zimske sportove: [skije i pancerice](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), snoubord daske i čizme, [ski odeća](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca), kacige, naočare i štapovi, kao i [sanke i klizaljke](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke). Dužinu skija i veličinu birate u filteru, a ponuda je najveća pred početak sezone.

Dužinu skija birajte prema visini, težini i znanju: početnicima odgovaraju kraće i mekše. Pogledajte ivice i klizne površine, a vezove obavezno dajte na podešavanje u servis. Pancerice se biraju po dužini stopala u centimetrima i moraju da stežu ravnomerno, bez žuljanja. Kacigu koja je pretrpela udarac ne treba kupovati. Prodavci neka navedu dužinu, radijus, model vezova i broj sezona. Smeštaj uz staze potražite na stranicama [Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik) i [Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Winter sports equipment: [skis and ski boots](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), snowboards and boots, [ski clothing](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca), helmets, goggles and poles, plus [sledges and ice skates](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke). You choose the ski length and the size in the filter, and the offer is biggest just before the season starts.

Choose the ski length by your height, weight and skill: shorter and softer skis suit beginners. Look at the edges and the bases, and always have the bindings adjusted at a service shop. Ski boots are chosen by foot length in centimetres and must grip evenly, without pressure points. A helmet that has taken a blow should not be bought. Sellers should state the length, the radius, the binding model and the number of seasons. Look for accommodation by the slopes on the [Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik) and [Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) pages.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Baštenski nameštaj za dvorište, terasu i balkon: baštenske garniture od ratana, drveta, metala i plastike, ljuljaške, ležaljke, suncobrani i tende. Vrstu nameštaja birate u filteru, a najveći izbor je u proleće, pred sezonu.

Materijal birajte prema mestu gde će nameštaj stajati: drvo traži redovnu zaštitu, metal treba da bude pocinkovan ili plastificiran, a veštački ratan lako se održava i podnosi kišu. Kod polovnih garnitura proverite spojeve, tragove rđe i stanje jastuka, a kod ljuljaški nosivost i platno. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije stola, broj mesta i da li se nameštaj sklapa. Za dečji kutak pogledajte [ljuljaške i tobogane](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani), za letnje večeri [roštilje](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), a za travnjak [kosilice i trimere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri).', text_en = 'Garden furniture for the yard, terrace and balcony: sets in rattan, wood, metal and plastic, swing seats, sun loungers, parasols and awnings. You choose the type of furniture in the filter, and the widest choice is in spring, before the season.

Choose the material by where the furniture will stand: wood needs regular protection, metal should be galvanised or powder-coated, and synthetic rattan is easy to maintain and copes with rain. With used sets, check the joints, traces of rust and the state of the cushions, and with swing seats the load capacity and the canopy. Sellers should state the size of the table, the number of seats and whether the furniture folds. For a children''s corner see [garden swings and slides](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani), for summer evenings [grills and barbecues](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), and for the lawn [mowers and trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri).' WHERE slug = 'garden-furniture' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Baštenski nameštaj za dvorište, terasu i balkon: baštenske garniture od ratana, drveta, metala i plastike, ljuljaške, ležaljke, suncobrani i tende. Vrstu nameštaja i materijal birate u filteru, a najveći izbor je u proleće, pred sezonu.

Materijal birajte prema mestu gde će nameštaj stajati: drvo traži redovnu zaštitu, metal treba da bude pocinkovan ili plastificiran, a veštački ratan lako se održava i podnosi kišu. Kod polovnih garnitura proverite spojeve, tragove rđe i stanje jastuka, a kod ljuljaški nosivost i platno. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije stola, broj mesta i da li se nameštaj sklapa. Za dečji kutak pogledajte [ljuljaške i tobogane](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani), za letnje večeri [roštilje](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), a za travnjak [kosilice i trimere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Garden furniture for the yard, terrace and balcony: sets in rattan, wood, metal and plastic, swing seats, sun loungers, parasols and awnings. You choose the type of furniture and the material in the filter, and the widest choice is in spring, before the season.

Choose the material by where the furniture will stand: wood needs regular protection, metal should be galvanised or powder-coated, and synthetic rattan is easy to maintain and copes with rain. With used sets, check the joints, traces of rust and the state of the cushions, and with swing seats the load capacity and the canopy. Sellers should state the size of the table, the number of seats and whether the furniture folds. For a children''s corner see [garden swings and slides](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani), for summer evenings [grills and barbecues](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), and for the lawn [mowers and trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Kolica za bebe i decu: [kolica 3u1 i 2u1](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kolica-3-u-1) sa košem i auto-sedištem, lagana [kišobran kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica), sportska kolica i kolica za blizance. Vrstu kolica birate u filteru.

Kolica isprobajte uživo: sklopite ih i rasklopite, proverite kočnicu, pojaseve, točkove i amortizere i da li je ram čvrst. Izmerite gepek, jer sklopljena kolica 3u1 zauzimaju dosta mesta. Pitajte šta ide u kompletu: kišna navlaka, torba, komarnik, adapteri za sedište. Navlake koje se skidaju i peru veliki su plus. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model, godinu kupovine i koliko je dece koristilo kolica. Bezbednost u vožnji obezbeđuju [auto-sedišta](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), a ostalo, od hranilica do njihalica, naći ćete u [opremi za bebe](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe).', text_en = 'Prams and pushchairs: [3-in-1 and 2-in-1 travel systems](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kolica-3-u-1) with a carrycot and car seat, light [umbrella strollers](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica), jogging strollers and twin pushchairs. You choose the type of stroller in the filter.

Try the stroller in person: fold and unfold it, check the brake, the harness, the wheels and suspension, and that the frame is solid. Measure your car boot, because a folded 3-in-1 takes up a lot of room. Ask what is included: rain cover, bag, insect net, seat adapters. Covers that come off and can be washed are a big plus. Sellers should state the brand, the model, the year of purchase and how many children used the stroller. Safety on the road comes from [car seats](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), and the rest, from high chairs to bouncers, is in [baby gear](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe).' WHERE slug = 'strollers' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Kolica za bebe i decu: [kolica 3u1 i 2u1](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kolica-3-u-1) sa košem i auto-sedištem, lagana [kišobran kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica), sportska kolica i kolica za blizance. Vrstu kolica i uzrast deteta birate u filteru.

Kolica isprobajte uživo: sklopite ih i rasklopite, proverite kočnicu, pojaseve, točkove i amortizere i da li je ram čvrst. Izmerite gepek, jer sklopljena kolica 3u1 zauzimaju dosta mesta. Pitajte šta ide u kompletu: kišna navlaka, torba, komarnik, adapteri za sedište. Navlake koje se skidaju i peru veliki su plus. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model, godinu kupovine i koliko je dece koristilo kolica. Bezbednost u vožnji obezbeđuju [auto-sedišta](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), a ostalo, od hranilica do njihalica, naći ćete u [opremi za bebe](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Prams and pushchairs: [3-in-1 and 2-in-1 travel systems](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kolica-3-u-1) with a carrycot and car seat, light [umbrella strollers](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica), jogging strollers and twin pushchairs. You choose the type of stroller and the child''s age in the filter.

Try the stroller in person: fold and unfold it, check the brake, the harness, the wheels and suspension, and that the frame is solid. Measure your car boot, because a folded 3-in-1 takes up a lot of room. Ask what is included: rain cover, bag, insect net, seat adapters. Covers that come off and can be washed are a big plus. Sellers should state the brand, the model, the year of purchase and how many children used the stroller. Safety on the road comes from [car seats](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), and the rest, from high chairs to bouncers, is in [baby gear](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe).';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Auto-sedišta, busteri i nosiljke za decu: jaja za novorođenčad, sedišta za decu do 36 kilograma, modeli sa isofix sistemom i okretnim postoljem, kao i kengur nosiljke i marame. U filteru birate sedišta ili nosiljke.

Sedište birajte prema visini i težini deteta i proverite da li odgovara vašem automobilu, posebno ako se kači na isofix. Polovno sedište kupujte samo ako sigurno znate da nije bilo u udesu: oštećenja se ne vide, a sedište više ne štiti. Na nalepnici pogledajte oznaku homologacije i datum proizvodnje, jer plastika vremenom stari. Proverite pojaseve i kopču. Prodavci neka navedu marku, grupu, godinu proizvodnje i da li ide baza. Za šetnju pogledajte [kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica), a ostalu [auto opremu](/oglasi/vozila/auto-oprema) naći ćete među oglasima za vozila.', text_en = 'Car seats, boosters and baby carriers: infant carriers for newborns, seats for children up to 36 kilograms, models with isofix and a swivel base, plus baby carriers and slings. In the filter you pick seats or carriers.

Choose the seat by the child''s height and weight and check that it fits your car, especially if it attaches with isofix. Buy a used seat only if you know for certain it has not been in a crash: the damage cannot be seen, yet the seat no longer protects. On the label, look for the approval mark and the production date, because plastic ages over time. Check the harness and the buckle. Sellers should state the brand, the group, the year of manufacture and whether the base is included. For walks see [strollers](/oglasi/deca/kolica), and other [car accessories](/oglasi/vozila/auto-oprema) are among the vehicle ads.' WHERE slug = 'car-seats' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Auto-sedišta, busteri i nosiljke za decu: jaja za novorođenčad, sedišta za decu do 36 kilograma, modeli sa isofix sistemom i okretnim postoljem, kao i kengur nosiljke i marame. Uzrast deteta birate u filteru.

Sedište birajte prema visini i težini deteta i proverite da li odgovara vašem automobilu, posebno ako se kači na isofix. Polovno sedište kupujte samo ako sigurno znate da nije bilo u udesu: oštećenja se ne vide, a sedište više ne štiti. Na nalepnici pogledajte oznaku homologacije i datum proizvodnje, jer plastika vremenom stari. Proverite pojaseve i kopču. Prodavci neka navedu marku, grupu, godinu proizvodnje i da li ide baza. Za šetnju pogledajte [kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica), a ostalu [auto opremu](/oglasi/vozila/auto-oprema) naći ćete među oglasima za vozila.' AND BINARY text_en = 'Car seats, boosters and baby carriers: infant carriers for newborns, seats for children up to 36 kilograms, models with isofix and a swivel base, plus baby carriers and slings. You choose the child''s age in the filter.

Choose the seat by the child''s height and weight and check that it fits your car, especially if it attaches with isofix. Buy a used seat only if you know for certain it has not been in a crash: the damage cannot be seen, yet the seat no longer protects. On the label, look for the approval mark and the production date, because plastic ages over time. Check the harness and the buckle. Sellers should state the brand, the group, the year of manufacture and whether the base is included. For walks see [strollers](/oglasi/deca/kolica), and other [car accessories](/oglasi/vozila/auto-oprema) are among the vehicle ads.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Bicikli i trotineti za decu: balans bicikli bez pedala, bicikli sa pomoćnim točkovima, modeli od 12 do 24 inča, tricikli i trotineti na dva i tri točka. U filteru birate bicikle ili trotinete.

Veličinu birajte prema visini deteta, a ne prema godinama: dete treba da stopalima dohvati tlo dok sedi. Ne kupujte veći bicikl „da traje“, jer ga dete teže kontroliše. Proverite kočnice, lanac, gume i da li se volan i sedište podešavaju po visini. Kod trotineta pogledajte ležajeve i mehanizam za sklapanje. Uz bicikl obavezno nabavite i kacigu. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu točka, uzrast i stanje guma. Kad dete preraste dečji model, pogledajte [bicikle](/oglasi/sport/bicikli), a rolere i skejtove naći ćete u kategoriji [roleri i skejt](/oglasi/sport/roleri-i-skejt).', text_en = 'Bikes and scooters for children: balance bikes without pedals, bikes with stabilisers, models from 12 to 24 inches, tricycles and two- and three-wheel scooters. In the filter you pick bikes or scooters.

Choose the size by the child''s height, not age: the child should reach the ground with their feet while seated. Do not buy a bigger bike "to last", because the child will find it harder to control. Check the brakes, the chain, the tyres and whether the handlebars and saddle adjust in height. On a scooter, look at the bearings and the folding mechanism. Always get a helmet with the bike. Sellers should state the wheel size, the age range and the condition of the tyres. When the child outgrows a children''s model, see [bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli); roller skates and skateboards are in [skates and skateboards](/oglasi/sport/roleri-i-skejt).' WHERE slug = 'kids-bikes' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Bicikli i trotineti za decu: balans bicikli bez pedala, bicikli sa pomoćnim točkovima, modeli od 12 do 24 inča, tricikli i trotineti na dva i tri točka. Veličinu točka birate u filteru.

Veličinu birajte prema visini deteta, a ne prema godinama: dete treba da stopalima dohvati tlo dok sedi. Ne kupujte veći bicikl „da traje“, jer ga dete teže kontroliše. Proverite kočnice, lanac, gume i da li se volan i sedište podešavaju po visini. Kod trotineta pogledajte ležajeve i mehanizam za sklapanje. Uz bicikl obavezno nabavite i kacigu. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu točka, uzrast i stanje guma. Kad dete preraste dečji model, pogledajte [bicikle](/oglasi/sport/bicikli), a rolere i skejtove naći ćete u kategoriji [roleri i skejt](/oglasi/sport/roleri-i-skejt).' AND BINARY text_en = 'Bikes and scooters for children: balance bikes without pedals, bikes with stabilisers, models from 12 to 24 inches, tricycles and two- and three-wheel scooters. You choose the wheel size in the filter.

Choose the size by the child''s height, not age: the child should reach the ground with their feet while seated. Do not buy a bigger bike "to last", because the child will find it harder to control. Check the brakes, the chain, the tyres and whether the handlebars and saddle adjust in height. On a scooter, look at the bearings and the folding mechanism. Always get a helmet with the bike. Sellers should state the wheel size, the age range and the condition of the tyres. When the child outgrows a children''s model, see [bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli); roller skates and skateboards are in [skates and skateboards](/oglasi/sport/roleri-i-skejt).';
SQL;
